ing code\",\"app_provisioning_banner_title_card_added_successfully\":\"Card Added Successfully\",\"aus_card_scan_intro__label_the_issuance_date_of\":\"The issuance date of your proof of address must be within the past 180 days and clearly visible. Partially scanned documents will not be accepted.\",\"auth__2faSetup__description\":\"The verification code generated by your authenticator app\",\"auth__2faSetup__label\":\"2FA Code\",\"auth__2faSetup__title\":\"Enter 2FA code\",\"auth__appleSignInError\":\"Failed to sign in with Apple. Please try again.\",\"auth__banner__title\":\"Trade your predictions. Profit when you're right.\",\"auth__bottomsheet_verification_options\":\"Verification options\",\"auth__button_continue_email\":\"Continue with Email\",\"auth__button_continue_with_passkey\":\"Continue with Passkey\",\"auth__cdcSignInError\":\"Failed to sign in with Crypto.com. Please try again.\",\"auth__continueWithApple\":\"Continue with Apple\",\"auth__continueWithCdc\":\"Continue with Crypto.com\",\"auth__continueWithGoogle\":\"Continue with Google\",\"auth__createAccount\":\"Create account\",\"auth__createPasscode__confirmPasscode\":\"Confirm Passcode\",\"auth__createPasscode__continue\":\"Continue\",\"auth__createPasscode__description\":\"You will use your passcode to log in, unlock the app, and confirm transactions\",\"auth__createPasscode__passcode\":\"Passcode\",\"auth__createPasscode__resendCode\":\"Resend code\",\"auth__createPasscode__title\":\"Create Passcode\",\"auth__email\":\"Email\",\"auth__emailOtp__description\":\"Enter the 6-digit code sent to {recipient}\",\"auth__emailOtp__label\":\"Verification Code\",\"auth__emailOtp__resendCode\":\"Resend code\",\"auth__emailOtp__title\":\"Verify your Email address\",\"auth__emailPlaceholder\":\"Enter your email address\",\"auth__email_verify_tier_campaign_banner\":\"Verify your email for your first $5\",\"auth__googleSignInError\":\"Failed to sign in with Google. Please try again.\",\"auth__kyc_verify_tier_camp