rror\":\"Input a valid format: 14 digits\",\"cash_earn_edd__ven_tin__regex_error\":\"Input a valid format: 7 or 8 digits\",\"cash_earn_edd__vir_tin__regex_error\":\"Input a valid format: 9 digits\",\"cash_earn_edd__vnm_tin__12_digit_regex_error\":\"Input a valid format: 12 digits\",\"cash_earn_edd__vnm_tin__regex_error\":\"Input a valid format: 10 digits\",\"cash_earn_edd__zaf_tin__regex_error\":\"Input a valid format: 10 digits\",\"cash_earn_edd__zmb_tin__regex_error\":\"Input 1 or more characters\",\"cash_earn_overview__detail__action_button\":\"Agree and continue\",\"cash_earn_overview__detail__important_info\":\"To help the government fight the funding of terrorism and money laundering activities, federal law requires all financial institutions to obtain, verify, and record information that identifies each person who opens an account. What this means for you: When you open an account, we will ask for your name, address, date of birth, and other information that will allow us to identify you. We may also ask to see your driver’s license or other identifying documents. \\n\\nUSD Wallet - Green Dot account opening is subject to identity verification by Green Dot Bank. Banking services provided by Green Dot Bank, Member FDIC. Green Dot Bank also operates under the following registered trade names: GO2bank, GoBank and Bonneville Bank. All of these registered trade names are used by, and refer to, a single FDIC-insured bank, Green Dot Bank. Deposits under any of these trade names are deposits with Green Dot Bank and are aggregated for deposit insurance coverage.\",\"cash_earn_transfer__pending_page__transfer_description\":\"Thank you! We will notify you once your verification is completed.\",\"cash_out__button_done\":\"Done\",\"cash_out__close_accessibility\":\"Close cash out\",\"cash_out__closing_contracts\":\"Selling {0} of {1} contracts @ {2}\",\"cash_out__closing_contracts_no_price\":\"Selling {0} of {1} contracts\",\"cash_out__confirm_button\":\"Cash out {0}\",\"