ives in your bank account in 1-5 business days. Your bank may charge additional processing fee to receive SWIFT transactions.\",\"fiat_withdraw_explainer__label_usd_usd_swift_review_desc\":\"Most withdrawals process within minutes and we will notify you once your request has been approved. In some cases, such as your first withdrawal, a manual review of 1 to 3 days may be required.\\n\",\"fiat_withdraw_pull_amount__button_exceeds_withdrawable_balance\":\"Exceeds withdrawable balance\",\"fiat_withdraw_request_success_label_currency_withdrawal_requested\":\"{0} Withdrawal Requested\",\"fiat_withdraw_request_success_label_your_request_is_pending\":\"Your request is pending for review\",\"fiat_withdraw_withdraw_currency_button_insufficient_balance\":\"Insufficient balance\",\"fiat_withdraw_withdrawal_process_label_withdraw_currency_to_your\":\"Withdraw {0} to your bank account\",\"fiat_withdrawal_confirmation__button_cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"fiat_withdrawal_confirmation__button_confirm\":\"Confirm\",\"fiat_withdrawal_confirmation__label_received_amount\":\"Received Amount\",\"fiat_withdrawal_confirmation__label_your_bank_might_apply\":\"Please note: Your bank might apply a processing fee\",\"fiat_withdrawal_exceeds_withdrawable_balance\":\"Exceeds withdrawable balance\",\"fiat_withdrawal_label__fixed_fee\":\"A {0} fee will be applied to this transaction\",\"fiat_withdrawal_label__flat_fee\":\"A ${0} {1} fee will be applied to this transaction\",\"fiat_withdrawal_label__no_fee\":\"No fee will be charged on this transaction\",\"fiat_withdrawal_label__percentage_fee\":\"A {0}% fee will be applied to this transaction\",\"fiat_withdrawal_label__percentage_fee_minimum\":\"A {0}% fee will be applied to this transaction (min. fee {1})\",\"fiat_withdrawal_label__unsettle_amount\":\"{0} of your USD balance is being processed and unavailable for withdrawal. However, your full balance remains available for purchases.\",\"fiat_withdrawal_label__withdrawable_amount\":\"As your transfer 