"Which type of profile you will classify yourself?\",\"kyc_label_yearly_income\":\"Annual Income\",\"kyc_label_yearly_income_try_0_to_10000\":\"0-10,000\",\"kyc_label_yearly_income_try_0_to_250000\":\"0-250,000\",\"kyc_label_yearly_income_try_10001_to_50000\":\"10,001-50,000\",\"kyc_label_yearly_income_try_250000_to_750000\":\"250,000-750,000\",\"kyc_label_yearly_income_try_50001_to_100000\":\"50,001-100,000\",\"kyc_label_yearly_income_try_750000_to_2500000\":\"750,000-2,500,000\",\"kyc_label_yearly_income_try_above_100000\":\"Above 100,000\",\"kyc_label_yearly_income_try_above_2500000\":\"Above 2,500,000\",\"kyc_label_zipcode\":\"Zipcode\",\"kyc_onfido_in_progress\":\"Verifying your details...\",\"kyc_onfido_intro_bullet_camera\":\"Allow camera access when prompted\",\"kyc_onfido_intro_bullet_id\":\"Have your ID document ready (passport, driver's license, or national ID)\",\"kyc_onfido_intro_bullet_lighting\":\"Ensure good lighting for photos\",\"kyc_onfido_intro_bullet_place\":\"Find a quiet place for your selfie\",\"kyc_onfido_intro_continue\":\"Start Verification\",\"kyc_onfido_intro_description\":\"We need to verify your identity using a government-issued ID and a selfie.\",\"kyc_onfido_intro_prepare\":\"Before you start:\",\"kyc_onfido_intro_title\":\"Verify Your Identity\",\"kyc_onfido_pending_description\":\"We're reviewing your documents. This may take a few minutes.\",\"kyc_onfido_pending_title\":\"Verification in Progress\",\"kyc_pending_description\":\"Our team is hard at work reviewing your documents.\\nYou will receive an email notification once you have been approved.\",\"kyc_pending_title\":\"We're on it\",\"kyc_reclaim__button_confirm\":\"Confirm\",\"kyc_reclaim__button_login_with_account\":\"Log in with this account\",\"kyc_reclaim__button_recover_account\":\"Recover this account\",\"kyc_reclaim__button_try_again\":\"Try again\",\"kyc_reclaim__description_account_recovered\":\"Your Crypto.com account ({email}) is fully linked to OG.\",\"kyc_reclaim__description_recovery_failed\":\"We couldn't verify your account for trading. Please contact customer support for more information.\",\"kyc_reclaim__description_try_again\":\"We were unable to verify the information given. Please resubmit your information to complete your registration and ensure that the info is legible to recover your account.\",\"kyc_reclaim__label_choose_details\":\"Choose your account details to continue:\",\"kyc_reclaim__label_current_details\":\"Current details\",\"kyc_reclaim__label_processing\":\"Processing...\",\"kyc_reclaim__label_update_details\":\"Update account details\",\"kyc_reclaim__title_account_recovered\":\"Account recovered!\",\"kyc_reclaim__title_recovery_failed\":\"Account setup incomplete\",\"kyc_reclaim__title_try_again\":\"Let's try again\",\"kyc_rejected_button_proceed_to_login\":\"Proceed to Login\",\"kyc_rejected_content_welcome_cdc_user\":\"The identity details you entered match an existing Crypto.com account linked to OG ({masked_email}).\\nIf this is your account, you can log in or recover access to continue.\\n\\nIf you don't recognise this email, please \u003clink\u003econtact us\u003c/link\u003e immediately.\",\"kyc_rejected_content_your_cdc_account_linked\":\"Your Crypto.com account (\u003cemail\u003emaskedEmail\u003c/email\u003e) is fully linked to OG.com. Simply log in with that account to continue.\\n\\nIf you don't recognize this email, please \u003clink\u003econtact us\u003c/link\u003e immediately.\",\"kyc_rejected_content_your_details_match\":\"The identity details you entered match an existing \u003ccryptoLink\u003eCrypto.com\u003c/cryptoLink\u003e account linked to OG (\u003cemail\u003emaskedEmail\u003c/email\u003e).\\nIf this is your account, you can log in or recover access to continue.\\n\\nIf you don't recognise this email, please \u003clink\u003econtact us\u003c/link\u003e immediately.\",\"kyc_rejected_description\":\"\u003ctext\u003eWe regret to inform you that your account registration is unsuccessful. This may be due to one of the following reasons:\\n\u003c/text\u003e\u003cli\u003eYou are below the age of 18\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eYou have submitted something other than a government-issued identification\u003c/li\u003e\u003ctext\u003e\\nPlease contact us if you have questions.\u003c/text\u003e\",\"kyc_rejected_description_cdc_user\":\"\u003ctext\u003eWe were unable to complete your OG.com registration because this email is linked to a Crypto.com account that could not be verified. This may be due to one of the following reasons:\\n\u003c/text\u003e\u003cli\u003eYou are below the age of 18\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eYou have submitted something other than a government-issued identification\u003c/li\u003e\u003ctext\u003e\\nPlease contact us if you have questions.\u003c/text\u003e\",\"kyc_rejected_title\":\"We're sorry\",\"kyc_rejected_title_welcome_cdc_user\":\"Welcome, Crypto.com user!\",\"kyc_rejected_title_you_already_have_account\":\"You already have an account\",\"kyc_resubmission_message_pending__label_thank_you_we_will\":\"We will notify you once this is complete.\",\"kyc_resubmission_message_pending__label_verification_pending\":\"Verification Pending\",\"kyc_resubmission_message_unsuccessful__label_to_avoid\":\"Please resubmit your document\",\"kyc_resubmission_message_unsuccessful__label_verification_unsuccessful\":\"Verification Incomplete\",\"kyc_result_button_start_exploring\":\"Start exploring\",\"kyc_result_button_submit\":\"Submit\",\"kyc_result_contact_customer_support\":\"Contact customer support\",\"kyc_selection_others\":\"Others\",\"kyc_verifying_identity\":\"Verifying your details...\",\"landing__button_apply_code\":\"Apply code\",\"landing__button_claim_it\":\"Claim it\",\"landing__button_continue_email\":\"Continue with email\",\"landing__button_login\":\"Login\",\"landing__button_show_more_options\":\"Show more options\",\"landing__button_sign_up_apple\":\"Sign up with Apple\",\"landing__button_sign_up_email\":\"Sign up with emai