{terms_of_use_privacy_url}\\\").\",\"nbaB1__faq_campaign_rules\":\"Campaign rules\",\"nbaB1__faq_campaign_rules_copy\":\"Trade Basketball markets during the campaign window to climb the leaderboard. Your total trading volume sets your rank, and the top finishers split the prize pool.\",\"nbaB1__faq_rewards_distribution\":\"Cash prizes will be awarded within 14 business days from the end of the campaign, by November 10, 2026.\",\"nbaB1__faq_when_rewards_distributed\":\"When are rewards distributed\",\"nbaB1__faq_who_can_participate\":\"Who can participate\",\"nbaB1__faq_who_eligibility\":\"All KYC-approved users can join. Tap Join now to enroll — only volume traded after you join counts toward your rank.\",\"nbaB1__header_title\":\"Tipoff Leaderboard\",\"nbaB1__hero_headline\":\"Trade Basketball, win from a {prizePool} Cash Prize Pool\",\"nbaB1__hero_see_more\":\"See more\",\"nbaB1__hero_top_share\":\"Top {winnerCount} wins\",\"nbaB1__label_cash_prize_suffix\":\"{prize} Cash Prize\",\"nbaB1__label_leaderboard\":\"Leaderboard\",\"nbaB1__label_leaderboard_coming_soon\":\"No standings yet\",\"nbaB1__label_no_reward_yet\":\"No reward yet\",\"nbaB1__label_not_joined_copy\":\"Join now to compete for the {prizePool} cash prize\",\"nbaB1__label_volume_suffix\":\"{volume} Vol.\",\"nbaB1__label_you_badge\":\"You\",\"nbaB1__label_your_progress\":\"Your Progress\",\"nbaB1__label_your_rank\":\"Your rank\",\"nbaB1__label_your_volume\":\"Your volume\",\"nbaB1__leaderboard_col_prize_volume\":\"Prize/ Trading Vol.\",\"nbaB1__leaderboard_col_rank\":\"Rank\",\"nbaB1__nudge_almost_top_100\":\"Almost top 100! Trade {amount} more for a cash prize.\",\"nbaB1__nudge_congrats_top_100\":\"Congratulations! You are top 100, trade more and climb\",\"nbaB1__nudge_trade_to_crack\":\"Start trading for a shot at cash prizes\",\"nbaB1__rules_header\":\"Rules and FAQs\",\"nbaB1__sheet_col_current_prize\":\"Current Prize\",\"nbaB1__sheet_col_projection\":\"Prize for {volume} Vol.\",\"nbaB1__sheet_col_r