clare that the information provided is, to the best of my knowledge and belief, accurate and complete. I also undertake to advise the recipient promptly and provide an updated Self-Certification where any change in circumstance occurs which causes any of the information contained in this form to be incorrect.\",\"og_edd_address_banner__cta_contact_support\":\"Contact customer support\",\"og_edd_address_banner__cta_resubmit_now\":\"Resubmit now\",\"og_edd_address_banner__cta_submit_now\":\"Submit now\",\"og_edd_address_banner__pending_retry_msg\":\"Your address couldn't be verified. Resubmit to continue\",\"og_edd_address_banner__pending_review_msg\":\"Address verification in progress. We're reviewing your documents and will update you soon\",\"og_edd_address_banner__pending_submit_msg\":\"Address verification pending. Submit now to avoid interruptions to your deposits, trades, and withdrawals\",\"og_edd_address_banner__rejected_msg\":\"Your address couldn't be verified. Contact customer support for help\",\"og_referral_ineligible_cap_reached_at_claim\":\"No reward available. Your referrer has reached their limit for this campaign, but check Promos for other offers.\",\"og_referral_raf_terms\":\"By proceeding, you are agreeing to the ^[Referral Program Terms \u0026 Conditions](link:\\\"{0}\\\")\",\"og_referral_share__use_my_referral_link\":\"Join OG.com with my code and earn up to {0}: {1}\\n{2}\",\"og_referral_share_subtitle\":\"Refer a friend, earn rewards together when they trade. Terms and conditions apply.\",\"og_referral_success_default\":\"Code applied. You're all set!\",\"og_referral_success_with_campaign\":\"Successfully added to your promos\",\"og_social_new_follower_batch_body\":\"{0}, {1} and {2} more followed you\",\"og_social_new_follower_batch_title\":\"New followers\",\"og_social_new_follower_pair_body\":\"{0}, {1} followed you\",\"og_social_new_follower_pair_title\":\"New followers\",\"og_social_new_follower_single_body\":\"{0} followed you\",\"og_so