to lock in profits or hold until the event ends. It's your call.\",\"onboardingModal__item3Title\":\"Get your payout\",\"onboardingModal__next\":\"Next\",\"onboarding_approved_label_documents_and_selfie_approved\":\"Documents and selfie approved\",\"onboarding_approved_label_information_approved\":\"Information approved\",\"onboarding_approved_label_your_verification_is_approved\":\"Your verification is approved\",\"onboarding_confirm_back_button_continue\":\"Continue\",\"onboarding_confirm_back_button_try_again\":\"Try Again\",\"onboarding_confirm_back_label_make_sure_that_all\":\"Make sure that all data on your document is fully visible, glare free and not blurred\",\"onboarding_confirm_back_label_this_is_the_back\":\"This is the back of your {0}\",\"onboarding_confirm_back_label_this_is_the_front\":\"This is the back of your {0}\",\"onboarding_confirm_back_label_this_is_the_photo\":\"This is the photo page of your passport\",\"onboarding_confirm_front_button_continue\":\"Continue\",\"onboarding_confirm_front_button_next\":\"Next\",\"onboarding_confirm_front_button_start_explore\":\"Start Exploring\",\"onboarding_confirm_front_button_try_again\":\"Try Again\",\"onboarding_confirm_front_label_make_sure_that_all\":\"Make sure that all data on your document is fully visible, glare free and not blurred\",\"onboarding_confirm_front_label_this_is_the_front\":\"This is the front of your {0}\",\"onboarding_confirm_liveness_check_button_complete_submission\":\"Complete Submission\",\"onboarding_confirm_liveness_check_button_try_again\":\"Try Again\",\"onboarding_confirm_liveness_check_header_identity_verification\":\"Identity Verification\",\"onboarding_confirm_liveness_check_label_confirmation\":\"Confirmation\",\"onboarding_confirm_liveness_check_label_please_make_sure_your\":\"Please make sure your face and all the supporting documents are clearly shown\",\"onboarding_confirm_selfie_label_make_sure_that_all\":\"Make sure that all data on your document is fully visible, glare free and not blurred\",\"onboarding_confirm_selfie_label_make_sure_that_your\":\"Make sure that your face is fully visible, glare free and not blurred\",\"onboarding_confirm_selfie_label_this_is_your_selfie\":\"This is your selfie\",\"onboarding_crypto_experience__description\":\"Help us personalize your Crypto.com experience\",\"onboarding_crypto_experience__option_crypto_investor\":\"Casual Investor \\n You trade a few times a month but mostly buy and hold.\",\"onboarding_crypto_experience__option_experienced_trader\":\"Active Trader \\n You’re an active trader who enjoys frequent trading.\",\"onboarding_crypto_experience__option_new_to_crypto\":\"New to Crypto \\n You're just starting to explore crypto.\",\"onboarding_crypto_experience__title\":\"Where are you in your crypto trading journey?\",\"onboarding_document_preparation_header_document_preparation\":\"Document Preparation\",\"onboarding_document_preparation_label_driver_license\":\"Driver License\",\"onboarding_document_preparation_label_for_security_reasons_you\":\"For security reasons, you will be required to complete the verification process within {0} minutes.\",\"onboarding_document_preparation_label_identity_card\":\"Identity Card\",\"onboarding_document_preparation_label_issuing_country\":\"Issuing Country\",\"onboarding_document_preparation_label_passport\":\"Passport\",\"onboarding_document_preparation_label_select_a_country\":\"Select a country\",\"onboarding_document_preparation_label_select_the_type_of\":\"Select the type of document to proceed with\",\"onboarding_edd_intro_description\":\"To protect you from theft and fraud, we are required by government regulations to collect your personal information.\",\"onboarding_edd_intro_title\":\"Questionnaire\",\"onboarding_email_confirm_label_your_email_address_is\":\"Your email address\\nis confirmed\",\"onboarding_email_required_error__description\":\"'Share My Email' is recommended for easier\\n communication and account recovery.\",\"onboarding_email_required_error__label_continue\":\"Continue Anyway\",\"onboarding_email_required_error__label_go_back\":\"Go Back\",\"onboarding_email_required_error__title\":\"Hide your email?\",\"onboarding_email_sent_alert_title_error_this_magic_link\":\"Error: This magic link has expired. Please check your email again for a new link.\",\"onboarding_email_sent_button_open_mail\":\"Open Mail\",\"onboarding_email_sent_button_resent\":\"Resend\",\"onboarding_email_sent_label_check_your_email_for\":\"Check your email for a confirmation link to continue\",\"onboarding_enter_phone_number_phone_number_error__button_try_again_in_mins\":\"Try again in {0} mins\",\"onboarding_failed_document_country_not_supported_by_foris\":\"We were unable to verify the information given due to the document being from a country where OG.com does not operate in.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration: \\n\\nDocument Requirement: \\n• Issued by a jurisdiction that OG.com operates in\\n\\nVisit the ^[FAQ](link:\\\"https://help.og.com\\\") for details.\",\"onboarding_failed_document_expired_id\":\"We were unable to verify the information given due to expired document.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration: \\n\\nDocument Requirement: \\n• Not expired\",\"onboarding_failed_document_readability_camera_black_white\":\"We were unable to verify the information given as your camera was set to black and white.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration:\\n\\nDocument Requirement: \\n• Camera setting is in colour, not black and white\",\"onboarding_failed_document_readability_different_persons_shown\":\"We were unable to verify the information given.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration:\\n\\nDocument Requirements: \\n• Fully captured (includes all corners)\\n• Text is clear and legible\\n\\nSelfie Requirements: \\n• Entire face is clearly captured\\n• Taken of your face directly and not of a photo\\n• Matches your identification document photo\",\"onboarding_failed_document_readability_digital_copy\":\"We were unable to verify the information given due to unreadable document. \\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration: \\n\\nDocument Requirement: \\n• A scan or picture of the original document\\n• Images of photocopies, scans, or digital screens cannot be accepted.\",\"onboarding_failed_document_readability_missing_back\":\"We were unable to verify the information given due to incomplete document upload.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration: \\n\\nDocument Requirement: \\n• Upload the front and back\",\"onboarding_failed_document_readability_missing_signature\":\"We were unable to verify the information given as a signature is missing from your uploaded document.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration:\\n\\nDocument Requirement: \\n• You have signed the signature field in the document\",\"onboarding_failed_document_readability_no_document\":\"We were unable to verify the information given as there was no document captured.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration:\\n\\nDocument Requirements: \\n• Fully captured (includes all corners)\\n• Text is clear and legible\",\"onboarding_failed_document_readability_not_readable_document\":\"We were unable to verify the information given due to unreadable document. \\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration: \\n\\nDocument Requirements: \\n• Fully captured (includes all corners)\\n• Text is clear and legible\",\"onboarding_failed_document_readability_photocopy_black_white\":\"We were unable to verify the information given as some of the documents uploaded was in black and white.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration:\\n\\nDocument Requirement: \\n• A scan or picture of the original document\\n• Camera setting is in colour, not black and white\",\"onboarding_failed_document_readability_photocopy_color\":\"We were unable to verify the information given due to unreadable document. \\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration: \\n\\nDocument Requirement: \\n• A scan or picture of the original document \\n• Images of photocopies, scans, or digital screens cannot be accepted.\",\"onboarding_failed_document_readability_wrong_document_page\":\"We were unable to verify the information given as the document page uploaded is incorrect.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration:\\n\\nDocument Requirements: \\n• Clearly displays your name, date of birth, and other particulars\\n• Upload the front and back\",\"onboarding_failed_document_validity_denied_unsupported_id_type\":\"We were unable to verify the information given due to invalid document type.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration: \\n\\nValid Document: \\n\\n• Government-issued document (e.g., driver’s licence, national identity card)\",\"onboarding_failed_document_validity_denied_unsupported_id_type_only_passport\":\"We were unable to verify the information given.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration:\\n\\nValid Document: \\n\\n• Government-issued (e.g., driver's licence, national identity card)\",\"onboarding_failed_document_validity_denied_unsupported_id_type_reject_passport\":\"We were unable to verify the information given due to unsupported document type.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration: \\n\\nValid Document:\\n\\n• Government-issued (e.g., driver’s licence, national identity card)\",\"onboarding_failed_document_validity_expired_document\":\"We were unable to verify the information given due to expired document.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration: \\n\\nDocument Requirement: \\n• Not expired\",\"onboarding_failed_document_validity_unknown\":\"We were unable to verify the information given.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration:\\n\\nDocument Requirements: \\n• Fully captured (includes all corners)\\n• Text is clear and legible\",\"onboarding_failed_document_validity_unsupported_country\":\"We were unable to verify the information given due to the document being from a country where OG.com does not operate in.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration: \\n\\nDocument Requirement: \\n• Issued by a jurisdiction that OG.com operates in\\n\\nVisit the ^[FAQ](link:\\\"https://help.og.com\\\") for details.\",\"onboarding_failed_france_entity_eea_documents\":\"We were unable to verify the information given as the document was from an unsupported country.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration:\\n\\nDocument Requirement: \\n• Issued by a European Economic Area country, the United Kingdom, or Switzerland\",\"onboarding_failed_phone_document_mismatch\":\"We were unable to verify the information given as the issuing country of your document does not match your phone number’s country code.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration:\\n\\nDocument Requirement: \\n• Issuing country must match your phone number’s country code\",\"onboarding_failed_selfie_similarity_no_match\":\"We were unable to verify the information given.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration: \\n\\nDocument Requirements: \\n• Fully captured (includes all corners)\\n• Text is clear and legible\\n\\nSelfie Requirements: \\n• Entire face is clearly captured\\n• Taken of your face directly and not of a photo\\n• Matches your identification document photo\",\"onboarding_failed_selfie_similarity_unlikely_match\":\"We were unable to verify the information given due to selfie and identification photo mismatch.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration: \\n\\nDocument Requirements: \\n• Fully captured (includes all corners)\\n• Text is clear and legible\\n\\nSelfie Requirements: \\n• Entire face is clearly captured\\n• Taken of your face directly and not of a photo\\n• Matches your identification document photo\",\"onboarding_failed_selfie_validity_age_difference_too_big\":\"We were unable to verify the information given.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration:\\n\\nDocument Requirements: \\n• Fully captured (includes all corners)\\n• Text is clear and legible\\n\\nSelfie Requirements: \\n• Entire face is clearly captured\\n• Taken of your face directly and not of a photo\\n• Matches your identification document photo\",\"onboarding_failed_selfie_validity_bad_quality\":\"We were unable to verify the information because your selfie is not clear enough.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration: \\n\\nDocument Requirements: \\n• Fully captured (includes all corners)\\n• Text is clear and legible\\n\\nSelfie Requirements: \\n• Entire face is clearly captured\\n• Taken of your face directly and not of a photo\",\"onboarding_failed_selfie_validity_black_and_white\":\"We were unable to verify the information given as some of the documents uploaded was in black and white.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration:\\n\\nDocument Requirements: \\n• Fully captured (includes all corners)\\n• Text is clear and legible\\n\\nSelfie Requirement: \\n• Camera setting is in colour, not black and white\",\"onboarding_failed_selfie_validity_cropped_from_id\":\"We were unable to verify the information given.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration:\\n\\nDocument Requirements: \\n• Fully captured (includes all corners)\\n• Text is clear and legible\\n\\nSelfie Requirements: \\n• Entire face is clearly captured\\n• Taken of your face directly and not of a photo\",\"onboarding_failed_selfie_validity_entire_id_used_as_selfie\":\"We were unable to verify the information given.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration:\\n\\nDocument Requirements: \\n• Fully captured (includes all corners)\\n• Text is clear and legible\\n\\nSelfie Requirements: \\n• Entire face is clearly captured\\n• Taken of your face directly and not of a photo\",\"onboarding_failed_selfie_validity_face_not_fully_visible\":\"We were unable to verify the information because your face was not fully captured.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration: \\n\\nDocument Requirements: \\n• Fully captured (includes all corners)\\n• Text is clear and legible\\n\\nSelfie Requirements: \\n• Entire face is clearly captured\\n• Taken of your face directly and not of a photo\",\"onboarding_failed_selfie_validity_is_screen_paper_video\":\"We were unable to verify the information given.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration:\\n\\nDocument Requirements: \\n• Fully captured (includes all corners)\\n• Text is clear and legible\\n\\nSelfie Requirements: \\n• Entire face is clearly captured\\n• Taken of your face directly and not of a photo\",\"onboarding_failed_selfie_validity_liveness_failed\":\"We were unable to verify the information given due to the poor selfie quality during the liveness check.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration: \\n\\nDocument Requirements: \\n• Fully captured (includes all corners)\\n• Text is clear and legible\\n\\nSelfie Requirements: \\n• Entire face is clearly captured\\n• Taken of your face directly and not of a photo\",\"onboarding_failed_selfie_validity_multiple_people\":\"We were unable to verify the information given as multiple people were detected in the selfie.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration:\\n\\nDocument Requirements: \\n• Fully captured (includes all corners)\\n• Text is clear and legible\\n\\nSelfie Requirement: \\n• You are the only person in the selfie\",\"onboarding_failed_selfie_validity_no_face_present\":\"We were unable to verify the information given as we could not detect your face in the selfie.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration:\\n\\nDocument Requirements: \\n• Fully captured (includes all corners)\\n• Text is clear and legible\\n\\nSelfie Requirements: \\n• Entire face is clearly captured\\n• Taken of your face directly and not of a photo\",\"onboarding_failed_selfie_validity_not_possible\":\"We were unable to verify the information given.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration:\\n\\nDocument Requirements: \\n• Fully captured (includes all corners)\\n• Text is clear and legible\\n\\nSelfie Requirements: \\n• Entire face is clearly captured\\n• Taken of your face directly and not of a photo\",\"onboarding_failed_sgp_non_nric_holder\":\"We were unable to verify the information given.\\n\\nPlease retry one of the steps below to continue with account registration: \\n\\n• Recommended: Retrieve your identity verification information from Myinfo by logging in to Singpass\\n• For Singapore Citizens / Permanent Residents: Submit your National ID (NRIC) card \\n• For Foreigners: Submit your work pass containing a Foreign Identification Number (FIN), e.g., Work Permit, S Pass, Employment Pass\",\"onboarding_failed_sgp_user_unsupported_id_type\":\"We were unable to verify the information given.\\n\\nPlease retry one of the steps below to continue with account registration: \\n\\n• Recommended: Retrieve your identity verification information from Myinfo by logging in to Singpass\\n• For Singapore Citizens / Permanent Residents: Submit your National ID (NRIC) card \\n• For Foreigners: Submit your work pass containing a Foreign Identification Number (FIN), e.g., Work Permit, S Pass, Employment Pass\",\"onboarding_failed_usa_phone_with_non_usa_document\":\"We were unable to verify the information given because you did not submit a U.S. issued identification.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration: \\n\\nValid Documents: \\n\\n• U.S. state-issued driver’s license\\n• Other U.S.-based identity card\",\"onboarding_field_invalid_format\":\"Invalid format\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_button_primary\":\"Agree and continue\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_button_primary_brazil\":\"Agree and continue with CPF\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_button_primary_denmark\":\"Agree and continue with MitID\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_button_primary_finland\":\"Agree and continue with FTN\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_button_primary_france\":\"Agree and continue with L'Identité Numérique\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_button_primary_netherlands\":\"Agree and continue with iDIN\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_button_primary_norway\":\"Agree and continue with NBID\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_button_primary_singpass\":\"Agree and continue with Singpass\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_button_primary_sweden\":\"Agree and continue with SBID\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_button_secondary_no_signicat\":\"Scan my ID manually\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_button_secondary_no_singpass\":\"I do not have Singpass\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_label_description\":\"To protect you from theft and fraud, we are required by government regulations to collect your personal information including uploading ID.\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_label_description_denmark\":\"To protect you from theft and fraud, we are required by regulations to collect your personal information.\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_label_description_finland\":\"To protect you from theft and fraud, we are required by regulations to collect your personal information.\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_label_description_netherlands\":\"To protect you from theft and fraud, we are required by regulations to collect your personal information.\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_label_description_staking\":\"The minimum annual income requirement is S$300,000. \\n\\nUpon proceeding, your latest Notice of Assessment will be retrieved from Singpass to verify that you meet it.\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_label_description_sweden\":\"To protect you from theft and fraud, we are required by regulations to collect your personal information.\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_label_description_us\":\"To protect you from theft and fraud, we are required by government regulations to collect your personal information which may include uploading ID and Social Security Number.\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_label_description_us_ssn9\":\"Your social security number will only be used to verify your identity. It will be handled securely and will not be used for credit checks.\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_label_highlight_description_staking\":\"S$300,000\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_label_manual_flow_cta\":\"Capture Manually\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_label_manual_flow_title\":\"Having trouble?\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_label_subhead\":\"We recommend preparing a government approved ID for this step.\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_label_subhead_brazil\":\"You can verify your identity using your CPF number\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_label_subhead_denmark\":\"You can verify your identity using your MitID app\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_label_subhead_finland\":\"You can verify your identity using your FTN account\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_label_subhead_france\":\"You can verify your identity using your L'Identité Numérique app\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_label_subhead_netherlands\":\"You can verify your identity using your iDIN app\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_label_subhead_norway\":\"You can verify your identity using your NBID app\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_label_subhead_sweden\":\"You can verify your identity using your SBID app\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_label_title\":\"Enter your details\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_intro_label_title_staking\":\"Verify Your Income\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_pop_up__button_cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_pop_up__button_verify_now\":\"Continue\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_pop_up__label_description_this_process_may\":\"Please follow the on-screen instructions to verify your identity.\",\"onboarding_identity_verification_pop_up__label_title_verify_your_identity\":\"You will be redirected\",\"onboarding_intro_button_skip\":\"Skip\",\"onboarding_intro_footer_music\":\"Notes: This offer is launched by Crypto.com independently and there is no partnership between Crypto.com and the merchants in this offer. Crypto.com has the sole discretion to modify this offer at any time.\",\"onboarding_intro_label_all\":\"ALL\",\"onboarding_intro_label_music\":\"Pay with your card and we'll cover it.\",\"onboarding_intro_label_percentage\":\"5%\",\"onboarding_intro_label_the_best_place_to\":\"The best place to buy, sell and pay with crypto.\\nForget the banks. Let's go!\",\"onboarding_intro_label_travel\":\"10% Back on selected travel websites.\\n Unlimited Airport Lounge Access.\\n Full reimbursement on selected membership.\",\"onboarding_intro_label_up_to_cashback_on\":\"Up to 5% cashback on spending on your Crypto.com Visa Card.\",\"onboarding_intro_title_music\":\"Your everything.\\nAnd more.\",\"onboarding_intro_title_travel\":\"Your Travel. In Style.\",\"onboarding_intro_title_your_crypto_made_simple\":\"Your Crypto.\\nMade Simple.\",\"onboarding_intro_title_your_metal_card\":\"Your Metal Card.\\nBest Cashback. Ever.\",\"onboarding_invalid_code_msg\":\"This verification code is invalid. Please try again.\",\"onboarding_invalid_code_title\":\"Invalid Code\",\"onboarding_kyc_alert_message_please_comolete_the_process\":\"Please complete the process within 10 minutes.\",\"onboarding_kyc_alert_title_verification_session_expired\":\"Verification Session Expired\",\"onboarding_kyc_button_start_again\":\"Start again\",\"onboarding_kyc_message_ready_to_explore\":\"You are now ready to explore all our features\",\"onboarding_kyc_web_fail__button_try_again\":\"Try Again\",\"onboarding_kyc_web_fail__label_title_we_are_not_able\":\"We are not able to verify your identity. Please try again.\",\"onboarding_kyc_web_launch__button_continue\":\"Continue\",\"onboarding_kyc_web_launch__button_go_to_device_setting\":\"Go to Device Settings\",\"onboarding_kyc_web_launch__button_ok\":\"OK\",\"onboarding_kyc_web_launch__label_description_an_error_occurred\":\"An error occurred. Please try again.\",\"onboarding_kyc_web_launch__label_description_please_continue\":\"Please continue from your identity verification app.\",\"onboarding_kyc_web_launch__label_description_please_ensure\":\"Please ensure you are using a supported browser on your device. You can enable browser access in Settings and try again.\",\"onboarding_kyc_web_launch__label_title_browser_access_required\":\"Browser Access Required\",\"onboarding_kyc_web_launch__label_title_open_app\":\"Open App\",\"onboarding_kyc_web_launch__label_title_try_again\":\"Try Again\",\"onboarding_landing__button_sign_in\":\"Sign In\",\"onboarding_landing__button_sign_up\":\"Sign Up\",\"onboarding_landing__label_your_crypto_journey_starts\":\"Your crypto journey starts here\",\"onboarding_liveness_check_header_identity_verification\":\"Identity Verification\",\"onboarding_liveness_check_intro_button_start_capture\":\"Start Capture\",\"onboarding_liveness_check_intro_header_instructions\":\"Instructions\",\"onboarding_liveness_check_intro_label_a_handwritten_note_containing\":\"A handwritten note containing this text: {0}\",\"onboarding_liveness_check_intro_label_crypto_com\":\"Crypto.com {0}\",\"onboarding_liveness_check_intro_label_please_take_a_photo_of\":\"Please take a photo of yourself holding in your hand(s):\",\"onboarding_liveness_check_intro_label_the_side_of_your\":\"The side of your document with your photo\",\"onboarding_login__button_cannot_login\":\"Can't log in?\",\"onboarding_login__button_login\":\"Log In\",\"onboarding_login__error_cdc_connect_disabled_message\":\"Crypto.com login isn't available for your OG.com account. Please continue with email or another login method.\",\"onboarding_login__error_cdc_connect_disabled_title\":\"Login method unavailable\",\"onboarding_login__error_code_recently_sent\":\"A verification code was recently sent. Please try again later.\",\"onboarding_login__error_cooldown_message\":\"Too many attempts. Please try again after {0} seconds.\",\"onboarding_login__error_disposable_email_message\":\"Invalid email address\",\"onboarding_login__error_email_mismatch_message\":\"The provided email is different.\",\"onboarding_login__error_expired_otp_message\":\"This code is no longer valid. Please enter the latest code sent to you, or request a new one.\",\"onboarding_login__error_internal_error_message\":\"Something went wrong. Please try again.\",\"onboarding_login__error_invalid_code_message\":\"Invalid code. Verification will be locked for {0} minutes after {1} failed attempts.\",\"onboarding_login__error_invalid_email_message\":\"Invalid email address.\",\"onboarding_login__error_invalid_email_otp_message\":\"Incorrect code. The account will be locked for {0} minutes after {1} failed attempts.\",\"onboarding_login__error_invalid_locale_message\":\"Invalid language.\",\"onboarding_login__error_invalid_otp_message\":\"Incorrect code. The account will be locked for {0} minutes after {1} failed attempts.\",\"onboarding_login__error_invalid_passcode_message\":\"{2, select, true {Incorrect passcode. The account will be locked for {0} minutes after {1} failed attempts.} other {Incorrect passcode. Use the same passcode as your Crypto.com account. The account will be locked for {0} minutes after {1} failed attempts.}}\",\"onboarding_login__error_invalid_phone_message\":\"Invalid mobile number.\",\"onboarding_login__error_invalid_recaptcha_message\":\"Invalid reCAPTCHA.\",\"onboarding_login__error_invalid_referral_code_message\":\"Invalid or expired promo code\",\"onboarding_login__error_invalid_session_state_message\":\"Something went wrong. Please refresh the page.\",\"onboarding_login__error_invalid_turnstile_message\":\"Invalid Turnstile Captcha.\",\"onboarding_login__error_passkey_not_found_message\":\"Passkey not found\",\"onboarding_login__error_phone_taken_message\":\"This phone number has already been registered. Please try again with another phone number.\",\"onboarding_login__error_rate_limit_exceeded_message\":\"Too many attempts. Please try again after {0} minutes.\",\"onboarding_login__error_recaptcha_not_loaded_message\":\"Recaptcha has not been loaded\",\"onboarding_login__error_recaptcha_threshold_not_met_message\":\"reCAPTCHA verification failed. Please try using a different network or device.\",\"onboarding_login__error_referrer_already_exists_message\":\"Referrer already exists\",\"onboarding_login__error_service_restricted_message\":\"Unfortunately we cannot offer OG.com services to you for the time being, due to market regulations.\",\"onboarding_login__error_too_many_verification_attempts\":\"Too many verification attempts. Try again in {0} minutes.\",\"onboarding_login__error_unsupported_jurisdiction_message\":\"Unfortunately we cannot offer OG.com services to you for the time being, due to market regulations.\",\"onboarding_login__error_your_account_is_locked\":\"Your account is locked due to too many verification attempts. Try again in {0} hours.\",\"onboarding_login__label_by_submitting_your_email_or_phone\":\"By submitting your email or phone number, you confirm you've read the relevant Privacy Notice, and opt-in to global payment and contact search\",\"onboarding_login__label_code_sent_to\":\"Code sent to {0} if the number is registered to an account\",\"onboarding_login__label_email_placeholder\":\"Your email address\",\"onboarding_login__label_enter_the_sms_verify_code\":\"Enter the SMS verification code\",\"onboarding_login__label_phone_number_placeholder\":\"Your phone number\",\"onboarding_login__label_privacy_notice_hyperlink\":\"Privacy Notice\",\"onboarding_login__label_resend_code\":\"Resend Code\",\"onboarding_login__label_verify_your_phone_number\":\"Verify your phone number\",\"onboarding_login__title_email\":\"Email\",\"onboarding_login__title_phone_number\":\"Phone Number\",\"onboarding_login_button_continue\":\"Log In to Existing Account\",\"onboarding_login_header_log_in\":\"Log In\",\"onboarding_login_label_i_accept_the_terms\":\"I accept the Terms and Conditions and Privacy Policy\",\"onboarding_login_label_log_out_now\":\"Log out now.\",\"onboarding_login_label_not_your_email\":\"Not your Email?\",\"onboarding_login_label_privacy_policy\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"onboarding_login_label_sign_up\":\"Sign up?\",\"onboarding_login_label_terms_and_conditions\":\"Terms and Conditions\",\"onboarding_login_label_we_notice_you_havent\":\"We notice you haven't registered yet.\",\"onboarding_login_label_your_email_address\":\"Your Email Address\",\"onboarding_login_placeholder_example_address_com\":\"Example@address.com\",\"onboarding_og_after_kyc_edd_pending_description\":\"Our team is hard at work reviewing your documents. In the meantime, continue to the final onboarding step. You will receive an email notification once you've been approved.\",\"onboarding_payment_currency_button_confirm\":\"Confirm\",\"onboarding_payment_currency_confirmed_label_payment_currency_confirmed\":\"Payment Currency Confirmed\",\"onboarding_payment_currency_confirmed_label_your_payment_currency_is\":\"Your payment\\ncurrency is set\\nas {0}\",\"onboarding_payment_currency_header_payment_currency\":\"Payment Currency\",\"onboarding_payment_currency_label_select_your_payment_currency\":\"Select your payment currency\",\"onboarding_payment_currency_label_your_payment_currency_is\":\"Your payment currency is used to display your balance, transactions, and purchase cryptocurrency throughout the app.\",\"onboarding_phone_confirm_label_your_phone_number_has\":\"Your phone number\\nhas been verified\",\"onboarding_phone_enter_date_of_birth_label\":\"Date of birth\",\"onboarding_phone_enter_find_info_description\":\"Verify your identity quicker by simply entering your mobile number and date of birth. We'll handle the rest.\",\"onboarding_phone_enter_find_info_title\":\"Find your info\",\"onboarding_phone_enter_send_code\":\"Send code\",\"onboarding_phone_enter_send_verification_sms\":\"Send Verification SMS\",\"onboarding_phone_enter_title\":\"Enter mobile number\",\"onboarding_phone_enter_verified_disclaimer\":\"By continuing, I agree that \u003clink\u003eVerified\u003c/link\u003e (OG.com’s service provider) and its vendors may receive my personal info and autofill more info about me, including my social security number.\",\"onboarding_pre_kyc_confirm_email__label_an_email_was_sent\":\"An email was sent to {0}. \\nVerify your email with the link to continue.\",\"onboarding_pre_kyc_confirm_email__label_click_the_link_in_email\":\"Click the link in the verification email sent to your registered email address\",\"onboarding_pre_kyc_confirm_email__label_verify_email_account\":\"Verify Email Account\",\"onboarding_pre_kyc_enter_email__label_email\":\"Email\",\"onboarding_pre_kyc_enter_email__label_what_is_your_email\":\"Create a new account\",\"onboarding_pre_kyc_enter_email__placeholder_your_email_address\":\"Your email address\",\"onboarding_pre_kyc_enter_otp__label_enter_six_digit_code\":\"Enter 6 digit code sent to {0}\",\"onboarding_pre_kyc_enter_otp__label_verify_your_mobile\":\"Verify your mobile number\",\"onboarding_pre_kyc_enter_phone__label_mobile_number\":\"Mobile Number\",\"onboarding_pre_kyc_enter_phone__label_what_is_your_mobile\":\"What is your mobile number?\",\"onboarding_pre_kyc_enter_phone__placeholder_your_mobile_number\":\"Your mobile number\",\"onboarding_pre_kyc_login_enter_otp__label_resend_code\":\"Resend code\",\"onboarding_pre_kyc_login_enter_otp__label_resend_code_in\":\"Resend code in {0}\",\"onboarding_pre_kyc_phone_country_picker__label_country_code\":\"Country Code\",\"onboarding_preferred_language_button_continue\":\"Continue\",\"onboarding_preferred_language_header_sign_up\":\"Sign up\",\"onboarding_preferred_language_label_select_your_preferred_language\":\"Select your preferred language\",\"onboarding_quiz_label\":\"Quiz\",\"onboarding_quiz_result__button_got_it\":\"Got it\",\"onboarding_quiz_result__button_maybe_later\":\"Maybe Later\",\"onboarding_quiz_result__button_retake\":\"Retake\",\"onboarding_quiz_result__failed_wait_for_hours_to_retake\":\"You have the option to retake the test after {0} hour(s). Meanwhile feel free to explore all other features.\",\"onboarding_quiz_result__label_continue\":\"Continue\",\"onboarding_quiz_result__passed_content\":\"Feel free to explore all our features. We're here to support your crypto journey every step of the way!\",\"onboarding_quiz_result__retake_the_test\":\"You have the option to retake the test.\",\"onboarding_quiz_result__sorry_you_did_not_pass\":\"Sorry, you didn’t pass.\",\"onboarding_quiz_result__you_are_all_set\":\"You’re all set!\",\"onboarding_quiz_result__you_did_not_pass\":\"You didn’t pass.\",\"onboarding_quiz_result__you_failed_score\":\"Your score: ^[{0}](color:'danger')/{1}\",\"onboarding_quiz_result__you_passed_score\":\"Your score: {0}/{1}\",\"onboarding_quiz_result__your_score\":\"Your Score\",\"onboarding_referral__code_label_you_will_only_be\":\"Some sign-up codes are region-locked. Your phone number must match the code’s region in order for it to be valid.\\n\\nYou are eligible to receive your signup bonus only after completing account setup. Bonuses are disbursed on a first come, first served basis.\",\"onboarding_referral_code_label_error_invalid_referral_code\":\"Error: Invalid Sign-Up Code\",\"onboarding_referral_code_label_referral_code\":\"Sign-Up Code*\",\"onboarding_referral_code_placeholder_referral01mco\":\"REFERRAL01MCO\",\"onboarding_reject_button_dismiss\":\"Dismiss\",\"onboarding_reject_label_account_verification_failed\":\"Account verification failed.\",\"onboarding_reject_label_contact_support\":\"Contact Support\",\"onboarding_reject_label_questions\":\"Questions?\",\"onboarding_reject_label_verification_request_declined\":\"Verification request declined\",\"onboarding_reject_label_verification_unsuccessful\":\"Verification Unsuccessful\",\"onboarding_reject_label_we_were_unable_to\":\"We were unable to process\\nyour verification request.\",\"onboarding_rejected_duplicate_id_number_approved_or_terminated_account\":\"Your account registration is unsuccessful because the information you submitted is associated with an existing account. \\n\\nIf you're having trouble logging in or have questions, please contact Customer Support.\",\"onboarding_rejected_duplicate_name_dob_approved_or_terminated_check\":\"Your account registration is unsuccessful because the information you submitted is associated with an existing account. \\n\\nIf you're having trouble logging in or have questions, please contact Customer Support.\",\"onboarding_rejected_singapore_user_with_banned_nationality\":\"We regret to inform you that your account registration is unsuccessful.\\n\\nPlease contact us if you have questions.\",\"onboarding_rejected_under_age\":\"We regret to inform you that your account registration is unsuccessful because you must be at least 18 years of age.\\n\\nYou may register for an account once you meet the minimum age requirement.\",\"onboarding_rejected_usa_phone_with_non_usa_document_maxed_attempts\":\"We regret to inform you that your account registration is unsuccessful because you did not submit a valid identification document.\\n\\nU.S. residents are required to submit a U.S.-issued identification document. \\n\\nPlease contact us if you have questions.\",\"onboarding_resubmit_button_resubmit\":\"Resubmit\",\"onboarding_resubmit_label_contact_support\":\"Contact Support\",\"onboarding_resubmit_label_please_resubmit_your_document\":\"Please resubmit your document\",\"onboarding_resubmit_label_questions\":\"Questions?\",\"onboarding_resubmit_label_there_is_an_issue_with_the_details\":\"There is an issue with the details you provided. Please resubmit.\",\"onboarding_resubmit_label_to_avoid_delays_in_verification\":\"To avoid delays in verification, ensure that the document you submit meets all requirements\",\"onboarding_resubmit_label_verification_incomplete\":\"Verification Incomplete\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc__label_status_success_content_uk\":\"You’re ready to start your crypto journey!\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_hard_fail_content\":\"We regret to inform you that your account registration is unsuccessful. This may be due to one of the following reasons: \\n\\n• You are below the age of 18\\n• You have submitted something other than a government-issued identification\\n• You are located in a jurisdiction where we do not operate\\n• The information you submitted is associated with another account\\n\\nPlease contact us if you have questions.\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_hard_fail_content_kr\":\"Unfortunately, it appears you do not meet the requirements to sign up. The causes for failed verification could be:\\n\\n • You are below the age of 19\\n • You have submitted something other than government approved identification\\n • You are located in a region where we do not operate.\\n\\n For more information, visit our Help Center\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_hard_fail_cta_title\":\"Contact Customer Support\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_hard_fail_title\":\"We're sorry\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_loading\":\"Processing documents\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_pending_content\":\"Our team is hard at work reviewing your documents. You will receive an email notification once you have been approved.\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_pending_cta_title\":\"Explore the App\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_pending_title\":\"We're on it\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_please_submit\":\"Please resubmit\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_soft_fail_content_non_doc_scan\":\"We were unable to verify the information given.\\n\\nPlease sign-in to your digital identity account to complete your registration.\\n\\nIf you want to register with your ID, please follow the document requirements:\\n• Fully captured the ID card (includes all corners)\\n• Use proper lighting, ensure text is clear and legible\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_soft_fail_content_signicat\":\"We were unable to verify the information given.\\n\\nPlease retry the steps below to continue with account registration:\\n\\nSign in to your digital identity account to retrieve your information again\\n\\nDocument requirements (for ID scan only):\\n • Fully captured (includes all corners)\\n • Text is clear and legible\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_soft_fail_cta_title_signicat\":\"Resubmit\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_soft_fail_title_signicat\":\"Almost there!\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_sort_fail_content\":\"We were unable to verify the information given. \\n\\nPlease resubmit your information to complete your registration and ensure that the info is legible before submitting: \\n\\n• Submit a valid identification document\\n• Ensure full visibility and clarity of uploaded materials\\n• Verify matching with your true identity details\\n• Exclude expired, blurred, or digitally altered copies\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_sort_fail_content_onfido_jumio\":\"We were unable to verify the information given.\\n\\nPlease resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration: \\n\\nDocument Requirements: \\n• Fully captured (includes all corners)\\n• Text is clear and legible\\n\\nSelfie Requirements: \\n• Entire face is clearly captured\\n• Taken of your face directly and not of a photo\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_sort_fail_content_signicat_singpass\":\"We were unable to verify the information given.\\n\\nPlease retry the steps below to continue with account registration: \\n\\nSign in to your digital identity account to retrieve your information again \\n\\nDocument requirements (for ID scan only): \\n• Fully captured (includes all corners)\\n• Text is clear and legible\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_sort_fail_content_us\":\"We were unable to verify the information given. Ensure that the info is clear and accurate before submitting.\\n\\nKindly resubmit your documents to proceed.\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_sort_fail_cta_title\":\"Resubmit\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_sort_fail_title\":\"Let's try again\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_success_content\":\"Congratulations! Make your first trade today.\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_success_content_uk\":\"You're ready to start your crypto journey!\",\"onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_success_title\":\"Verification Successful\",\"onboarding_scan_back_label_back_of\":\"Scan back of {0}\",\"onboarding_scan_back_label_bank_of\":\"Back of {0}\",\"onboarding_scan_back_label_make_sure_that_all\":\"Make sure that all data on your document is fully visible, glare free and not blurred\",\"onboarding_scan_front_label_make_sure_that_all\":\"Make sure that all data on your document is fully visible, glare free and not blurred\",\"onboarding_scan_front_label_please_position_all_four\":\"Please position all 4 corners of the {0} within the frame\",\"onboarding_scan_front_label_please_position_photo_page\":\"Please position photo page of passport within the frame\",\"onboarding_scan_front_label_scan_front_of\":\"Scan front of {0}\",\"onboarding_scan_front_label_scan_photo_page_of\":\"Scan photo page of passport\",\"onboarding_scan_front_subheader_time_remaining\":\"Time Remaining: {0}\",\"onboarding_scan_tips_dialog_button_ok_i_understand\":\"OK, I understand\",\"onboarding_scan_tips_dialog_label_attach_with_anything_eg\":\"Attached with anything, e.g. clips\",\"onboarding_scan_tips_dialog_label_blurry\":\"Blurry\",\"onboarding_scan_tips_dialog_label_folded_or_wrinkled\":\"Folded or wrinkled\",\"onboarding_scan_tips_dialog_label_please_ensure_your_documents\":\"Please ensure your documents are not:\",\"onboarding_scan_tips_dialog_label_too_bright_or_too\":\"Too bright or too dark\",\"onboarding_scan_tips_dialog_title\":\"Documents Scanning Tips\",\"onboarding_select_country_header_change_issuing_country\":\"Change Issuing Country\",\"onboarding_select_country_placeholder_select_issuing_country\":\"Select Issuing Country\",\"onboarding_select_mobile_carrier__label_economic_kt\":\"KT MVNO\",\"onboarding_select_mobile_carrier__label_economic_lgup\":\"LGU+ MVNO\",\"onboarding_select_mobile_carrier__label_economic_skt\":\"SKT MVNO\",\"onboarding_select_mobile_carrier__label_standard_kt\":\"KT\",\"onboarding_select_mobile_carrier__label_standard_lgup\":\"LGU+\",\"onboarding_select_mobile_carrier__label_standard_skt\":\"SKT\",\"onboarding_select_mobile_carrier__title_select_mobile_carrier\":\"Select mobile carrier\",\"onboarding_selfie_header_selfie\":\"Selfie\",\"onboarding_selfie_label_please_position_your_face\":\"Please position your face within the frame\",\"onboarding_selfie_label_take_a_selfie\":\"Take a selfie\",\"onboarding_set_passcode_header_set_passcode\":\"Set passcode\",\"onboarding_set_passcode_label_confirm_passcode\":\"Confirm passcode\",\"onboarding_set_passcode_label_set_a_passcode\":\"Set a passcode\",\"onboarding_set_passcode_label_this_passcode_is_used\":\"This passcode is used to unlock and confirm transactions\",\"onboarding_singpass__label_accredited_investor_title\":\"Confirm Your Singpass Details\",\"onboarding_singpass__label_assesable_income\":\"Assesable Income\",\"onboarding_singpass__label_confirm\":\"Confirm\",\"onboarding_singpass__label_failed_to_retrieve\":\"We couldn’t verify your details through Singpass. This could be due to either an unavailability with Singpass or other issues. Please try again or use another verification method to continue.\",\"onboarding_singpass__label_kindly_review\":\"Kindly review your Singpass details for identity verification.\\n\\nNote: The information below cannot be edited. If it is incorrect, please submit your verification document manually.\",\"onboarding_singpass__label_phone\":\"Phone\",\"onboarding_singpass__label_submit_document_instead\":\"Submit Document Instead\",\"onboarding_singpass__label_year_of_asessment\":\"Year of Assessment\",\"onboarding_singpass_loading__label_subitle\":\"We are working to verify. This may take a few minutes\",\"onboarding_singpass_loading__label_title\":\"Verification Pending\",\"onboarding_ssn_error_minimum_age\":\"You must be at least 18 years old\",\"onboarding_ssn_full_ssn_received_description\":\"Federal regulations require us to use your SSN to verify your identity and prevent fraud. Your full SSN has been securely received from Verified and the last 4 digits are pre-filled for your review. This encrypted check is strictly for security and has no impact on your credit score.\",\"onboarding_ssn_full_ssn_received_label\":\"Full SSN securely received\",\"onboarding_ssn_why_required_description\":\"Federal regulations require us to use your SSN to verify your identity and prevent fraud. This encrypted check is strictly for security and has no impact on your credit score.\",\"onboarding_ssn_why_required_label\":\"Why is my SSN required?\",\"onboarding_ssn_why_required_title\":\"Why do we ask for your SSN?\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_consumer_offer_aus_promo\":\"Buy $15 of crypto with AUD and get the chance to receive $15 back. T\u0026Cs apply.\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_consumer_offer_aus_promo_10_202401\":\"Buy $10 of crypto with your AUD Wallet to get $10 back. Valid in your first 7 days. T\u0026Cs and Privacy Notice apply.\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_consumer_offer_aus_promo_202311\":\"Buy $5 of crypto with AUD and get the chance to receive $5 back. T\u0026Cs apply.\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_consumer_offer_can_promo\":\"Buy $15 of crypto with CAD and get the chance to receive $15 back. T\u0026Cs apply.\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_consumer_offer_can_promo_202311\":\"Buy $5 of crypto with CAD and get the chance to receive $5 back. T\u0026Cs apply.\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_consumer_offer_can_promo_202312\":\"Buy $10 of crypto with your CAD Wallet to get $10 back. Valid in your first 7 days. T\u0026Cs and Privacy Notice apply.\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_consumer_offer_fra_promo_5_202311\":\"Buy €5 of crypto with your EUR Wallet and get the chance to receive €5 back. T\u0026Cs apply.\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_consumer_offer_global_promo_15_202401\":\"Buy $15 of crypto and get the chance to receive $15 back. T\u0026Cs and Privacy Notice apply.\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_consumer_offer_ita_promo_5_202311\":\"Buy €5 of crypto with your EUR Wallet and get the chance to receive €5 back. T\u0026Cs apply.\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_consumer_offer_ita_promo_5_202311_test\":\"Simply make your first crypto purchase with {0}. T\u0026Cs apply\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_consumer_offer_kr_trade_to_win_ucl_final_tickets\":\"Win up to ₩10,000 in BTC. Details here.\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_consumer_offer_uk_promo\":\"Sign up and buy £15 of any crypto with GBP to get an instant CRO rebate! T\u0026Cs apply.\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_consumer_offer_usa_promo_5_202311\":\"Buy $5 of crypto with your USD Wallet and get the chance to receive $5 back. T\u0026Cs and Privacy Notice apply.\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_consumer_offer_ww1_promo_5_202311\":\"Buy $5 of crypto and get the chance to receive $5 back. T\u0026Cs and Privacy Notice apply.\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_detail_consumer_offer_aus_promo\":\"T\u0026Cs apply\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_detail_consumer_offer_aus_promo_10_202401\":\"T\u0026Cs and Privacy Notice apply.\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_detail_consumer_offer_aus_promo_202311\":\"T\u0026Cs apply\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_detail_consumer_offer_can_promo\":\"T\u0026Cs apply\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_detail_consumer_offer_can_promo_202311\":\"T\u0026Cs apply\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_detail_consumer_offer_can_promo_202312\":\"T\u0026Cs and Privacy Notice apply.\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_detail_consumer_offer_fra_promo_5_202311\":\"T\u0026Cs apply\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_detail_consumer_offer_global_promo_15_202401\":\"T\u0026Cs and Privacy Notice apply.\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_detail_consumer_offer_ita_promo_5_202311\":\"T\u0026Cs apply\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_detail_consumer_offer_kr_trade_to_win_ucl_final_tickets\":\"Details here\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_detail_consumer_offer_uk_promo\":\"T\u0026Cs apply\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_detail_consumer_offer_usa_promo_5_202311\":\"T\u0026Cs and Privacy Notice apply.\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_detail_consumer_offer_ww1_promo_5_202311\":\"T\u0026Cs and Privacy Notice apply.\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_prime_banner_promo\":\"Get access to low trade fees, margin trading and get {0}% deposit bonus\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_prime_promo\":\"Experience unrivalled privileges designed for our high net worth traders\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_prime_term_v2\":\"Please read and agree to the following terms\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_welcome_pack_global_promo_500_202403\":\"Start claiming your time-limited token rewards. Jurisdiction restrictions apply.\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_welcome_pack_promo_bitcoin_202407\":\"Limited time only. Jurisdiction restrictions apply.\",\"onboarding_start__label_description_welcome_pack_promo_bitcoin_202408\":\"Jurisdiction restrictions apply.\",\"onboarding_start__label_i_agree_prime\":\"I understand and agree that my use of Crypto Prime is governed by the Crypto Prime T\u0026Cs.\",\"onboarding_start__label_operation_prime_banner_promo\":\"Claim Benefits\",\"onboarding_start__label_prime_term_and_agreement\":\"Terms \u0026 Agreement\",\"onboarding_start__label_prime_term_and_agreement_body\":\"Prime members do not qualify for and cannot avail themselves of the ^[Crypto.com](link:\\\"{0}\\\") Rewards+ programme.\\nRecurring Buy is not available.\\nThe same minimum conditions for relief as the Account Protection Programme set out in ^[this FAQ](link:\\\"{1}\\\") applies.All Prime users will be eligible for the Account Protection Programme, including the enhanced recovery limits set out in the aforementioned ^[FAQ](link:\\\"{1}\\\").\\nSubject to the maximum permitted by your banking service providers’ account limits.\\nShould the Minimum Asset Base fall below the requirement threshold at any time, including as a result of mark-to-market value of the cryptocurrencies or fiat currency foreign exchange fluctuations, the user will cease to qualify for Prime.\\nThe ^[Crypto.com](link:\\\"{0}\\\") Prime Card may not be available in your jurisdiction or you may need to accept card-specific terms and conditions as a pre-requisite.\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_consumer_offer_aus_promo\":\"Sign up now to receive $15\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_consumer_offer_aus_promo_10_202401\":\"Sign up now to receive AU$10\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_consumer_offer_aus_promo_202311\":\"Sign up now to receive $5\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_consumer_offer_can_promo\":\"Sign up now to receive $15\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_consumer_offer_can_promo_202311\":\"Sign up now to receive $5\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_consumer_offer_can_promo_202312\":\"Sign up now to receive CA$10\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_consumer_offer_fra_promo_5_202311\":\"Sign up now to receive €5\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_consumer_offer_global_promo_15_202401\":\"Sign up now to receive US$15\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_consumer_offer_ita_promo_5_202311\":\"Sign up now to receive €5\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_consumer_offer_ita_promo_5_202311_test\":\"Buy {0}, get {1}\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_consumer_offer_kr_trade_to_win_ucl_final_tickets\":\"Deposit + trade ₩10,000\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_consumer_offer_uk_promo\":\"Buy £15, get £15\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_consumer_offer_usa_promo_5_202311\":\"Sign up now to receive $5\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_consumer_offer_ww1_promo_5_202311\":\"Sign up now to receive $5\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_line_1\":\"Your crypto journey\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_line_2\":\"starts here.\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_line_3\":\" \",\"onboarding_start__label_title_prime_banner_promo\":\"You're In Elite Company\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_prime_promo\":\"Welcome to crypto's most exclusive circle\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_prime_term_v2\":\"You're one step closer to generational wealth\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_prime_term_v2_document_1\":\"Terms and conditions\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_prime_term_v2_document_2\":\"Eligible contract participant\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_welcome_pack_global_promo_500_202403\":\"Accelerate your crypto journey with US$500 in crypto\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_welcome_pack_promo_bitcoin_202407\":\"Accelerate your crypto journey with sign-up rewards\",\"onboarding_start__label_title_welcome_pack_promo_bitcoin_202408\":\"Get up to 1 BTC in rewards for starting your crypto journey\",\"onboarding_start_button_log_in\":\"Log in to existing account\",\"onboarding_start_button_sign_up\":\"Create New Account\",\"onboarding_start_label_description_consumer_offer_korea_promo_1m_202403\":\"Make your first purchase to win a 100% rebate. Plus, stand to win a pair of UFC 303 tickets and 5,000 USDC. Terms and conditions apply.\",\"onboarding_start_label_description_detail_consumer_offer_korea_promo_1m_202403\":\"Terms and conditions apply.\",\"onboarding_start_label_invited_add_referral_code\":\"Invited? Add sign-up code\",\"onboarding_start_label_referral_code_is_verified\":\"Sign-Up Code is verified!\",\"onboarding_start_label_the_referral_code_has\":\"The sign-up code has been verified successfully.\",\"onboarding_start_label_title_consumer_offer_korea_promo_1m_202403\":\"Sign up and stand to win ₩1M of BTC\",\"onboarding_success_button_contact_support\":\"Contact Support\",\"onboarding_success_button_explore_the_app\":\"Explore the App\",\"onboarding_success_set_passcode_label_passcode_set\":\"passcode\\nset\",\"onboarding_success_set_passcode_label_your_passcode_is_confirmed\":\"Your passcode is confirmed\",\"onboarding_success_submit_label_document_and_selfie_submitted\":\"Document and selfie submitted!\",\"onboarding_success_submit_label_documents_submitted\":\"Documents submitted!\",\"onboarding_success_submit_label_we_will_be_reviewing\":\"We will be reviewing your verification request shortly\",\"onboarding_success_submit_label_we_will_notify_you\":\"We’ll notify you within 2-3 business days once your account is verified\",\"onboarding_success_submit_label_you_can_still_access\":\"You can still access certain features and functions of the App\",\"onboarding_tell_us_more__button_continue\":\"Continue\",\"onboarding_tell_us_more__label_full_name\":\"Full Name (in Korean)\",\"onboarding_tell_us_more__label_id_number\":\"ID Card Number\",\"onboarding_tell_us_more__label_mobile_carrier\":\"Mobile Carrier\",\"onboarding_tell_us_more__placeholder_full_name\":\"Enter Full Name\",\"onboarding_tell_us_more__placeholder_id_number\":\"Enter ID Number\",\"onboarding_tell_us_more__placeholder_mobile_carrier\":\"Select Mobile Carrier\",\"onboarding_tell_us_more__title_tell_us_more_about\":\"Tell us more about you\",\"onboarding_thanks_for_joining_button_continue\":\"Continue\",\"onboarding_thanks_for_joining_button_maybe_later\":\"Maybe Later\",\"onboarding_thanks_for_joining_button_verify_my_identity\":\"Verify My Identity\",\"onboarding_thanks_for_joining_checkbox_yes_l_like_to\":\"Yes, I'd like to receive exclusive offers and updates from Crypto.com.\",\"onboarding_thanks_for_joining_header_sign_up\":\"Sign up\",\"onboarding_thanks_for_joining_label_privacy_policy\":\"Privacy Notice\",\"onboarding_thanks_for_joining_label_thanks_for_joining_us\":\"Thanks for joining us!\",\"onboarding_thanks_for_joining_label_we_love_to_send\":\"We'd love to send you exclusive offers and new updates, via email or in-app messages. We'll never sell your information to third parties. You can opt out/withdraw your consent at any time.\\n\\nHere's our Privacy Notice for further information about how we use and protect personal data.\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__button_got_it\":\"Got it\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_forgot_passcode\":\"Follow the steps below to reset your passcode:\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_forgot_passcode_hyperlink_1\":\"Forgot passcode?\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_forgot_passcode_hyperlink_2\":\"Log In Now\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_forgot_passcode_number_1\":\"Tap Forgot passcode? on the input passcode screen\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_forgot_passcode_number_2\":\"Complete the verification steps\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_forgot_passcode_number_3\":\"Open the passcode reset email sent to your inbox and tap the Log In Now button\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_forgot_passcode_number_4\":\"Set a new passcode and confirm it\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_forgot_registered_email_address\":\"Try searching ‘Crypto.com’ in all your inboxes to identify the email address that’s registered to your Crypto.com App account.\\n\\nTo ensure account security, please be reminded to confirm the sender and your Anti-Phishing Code if you have set it up.\\n\\nAlternatively, you can log in with your registered phone number by selecting Phone Number on the login page.\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_forgot_registered_email_address_hyperlink\":\"Phone Number\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_need_to_update_email_address\":\"Contact Customer Support if you have lost access to your registered email account and cannot receive the login email.\\n\\nTo do so, enter your registered phone number at login and tap the ‘chat’ icon on the top-right corner of the screen.\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_need_to_update_phone_number\":\"If you lost access to your registered phone number and cannot use it to log in, follow the steps below to update to a new number:\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_need_to_update_phone_number_hyperlink\":\"Didn't receive a code? \u003e Change phone number\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_need_to_update_phone_number_note\":\"Please note that the new number must have the same country code as your previous one.\\n\\nContact Customer Support if you need to change your country code. To do so, complete steps (1) and (2) above and tap the ‘chat’ icon on the top-right corner of the screen.\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_need_to_update_phone_number_number_1\":\"Enter your registered email address\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_need_to_update_phone_number_number_2\":\"Tap the login link sent to your inbox\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_need_to_update_phone_number_number_3\":\"On the SMS verification screen, tap Didn't receive a code? \u003e Change phone number\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_need_to_update_phone_number_number_4\":\"Follow the on-screen instructions to verify your new number\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_need_to_update_phone_number_number_5\":\"Log in with your new number\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_not_receive_login_email\":\"Check that you have entered the correct email address registered to your Crypto.com App account.\\n\\nYou may also try to:\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_not_receive_login_email_point_1\":\"Search your Spam and Trash folders\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_not_receive_login_email_point_2\":\"Access your inbox using your mobile browser\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_not_receive_login_email_point_3\":\"Clear cache and cookies from your web and mobile browser\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_not_receive_login_email_point_4\":\"Delete all login emails from your inbox and try again\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_not_receive_login_sms\":\"Check that you have entered the correct phone number registered to your Crypto.com App account.\\n\\nIf you cannot receive the SMS because you changed your phone number, follow the steps below to update it:\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_not_receive_login_sms_hyperlink\":\"Didn't receive a code? \u003e Change phone number\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_not_receive_login_sms_note\":\"Please note that the new number must have the same country code as your previous one.\\n\\nContact Customer Support if you need to change your country code. To do so, complete steps (1) and (2) above and tap the ‘chat’ icon on the top-right corner of the screen.\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_not_receive_login_sms_number_1\":\"Enter your registered email address\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_not_receive_login_sms_number_2\":\"Tap the login link sent to your inbox\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_not_receive_login_sms_number_3\":\"On the SMS verification screen, tap Didn't receive a code? \u003e Change phone number\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_not_receive_login_sms_number_4\":\"Follow the on-screen instructions to verify your new number\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_not_receive_login_sms_number_5\":\"Log in with your new number\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_select_the_issue\":\"Select the issue:\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_selected_issue\":\"Selected issue:\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_suggested_solution\":\"Suggested solution:\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_verification_link_is_invalid\":\"Make sure you are clicking on the link in the most recent login email that you received.\\n\\nYou may also try to:\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_verification_link_is_invalid_point_1\":\"Access your inbox using your mobile browser\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_verification_link_is_invalid_point_2\":\"Clear cache and cookies from your web and mobile browser\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__label_verification_link_is_invalid_point_3\":\"Delete all login emails from your inbox and try again\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__title_forgot_passcode\":\"Forgot passcode\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__title_forgot_registered_email_address\":\"Forgot registered email address\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__title_need_to_update_email_address\":\"Need to update email address\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__title_need_to_update_phone_number\":\"Need to update phone number\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__title_not_receive_login_email\":\"Didn’t receive the login email\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__title_not_receive_login_sms\":\"Didn’t receive the login SMS\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__title_troubleshooting\":\"Troubleshooting\",\"onboarding_troubleshooting__title_verification_link_is_invalid\":\"Email verification link is invalid\",\"onboarding_underage_retry_content\":\"Your previous verification could not be completed. Please resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration.\",\"onboarding_underage_retry_content_og_existing_cdc\":\"OG.com is powered by Crypto.com and uses the same account credentials. We found an existing Crypto.com application that requires updated verification. Please resubmit a valid identification document and selfie to complete your registration.\",\"onboarding_underage_retry_title\":\"Let's try again\",\"onboarding_unspported_country_label_sorry_the_crypto_com\":\"Sorry, the Crypto.com App is unavailable in your region currently. We will inform you once this changes.\",\"onboarding_unspported_country_label_verification_unsuccessful\":\"Verification Unsuccessful\",\"onboarding_unspported_country_label_view_supported_regions\":\"View Supported Regions\",\"onboarding_unsupported_juridition_phone_country_not_supported_by_foris\":\"We regret to inform you that your account registration is unsuccessful because the OG.com App does not operate in your jurisdiction.\\n\\nPlease contact us if you have questions.\",\"onboarding_unsupported_juridition_phone_country_not_supported_by_foris_og_web\":\"We regret to inform you that your account registration is unsuccessful because the OG.com Web does not operate in your jurisdiction.\\n\\nPlease contact us if you have questions.\",\"onboarding_unsupported_juridition_usa_banned_state\":\"We regret to inform you that your account registration is unsuccessful because the OG.com App does not operate in your state.\\n\\nPlease contact us if you have questions.\",\"onboarding_unsupported_juridition_usa_banned_state_og_web\":\"We regret to inform you that your account registration is unsuccessful because the OG.com Web does not operate in your state.\\n\\nPlease contact us if you have questions.\",\"onboarding_verification_pending_label_contact_support\":\"Contact Support\",\"onboarding_verification_pending_label_questions\":\"Questions?\",\"onboarding_verification_pending_label_thank_you_we_will\":\"We will notify you when your account is verified, which can take up to 24 hours during peak traffic times.\",\"onboarding_verification_pending_label_verification_pending\":\"Verification Pending\",\"onboarding_verify_email_button_continue\":\"Create New Account\",\"onboarding_verify_email_checkbox_i_accept_the_terms\":\"I accept the Terms \u0026 Conditions and I've read the Privacy Notice\",\"onboarding_verify_email_checkbox_privacy_policy\":\"Privacy Notice\",\"onboarding_verify_email_checkbox_terms_condition\":\"Terms \u0026 Conditions\",\"onboarding_verify_email_header_sign_up\":\"Create New Account\",\"onboarding_verify_email_label_log_out_now\":\"Log out now.\",\"onboarding_verify_email_label_not_your_email\":\"Not your Email?\",\"onboarding_verify_email_label_please_accept_our_terms\":\"Please accept our Terms \u0026 Conditions and Privacy Policy to continue.\",\"onboarding_verify_email_label_your_email_address\":\"Your Email Address\",\"onboarding_verify_email_placeholder_example_address_com\":\"example@address.com\",\"onboarding_verify_identity_button_continue\":\"Continue\",\"onboarding_verify_identity_header_verify_your_identity\":\"Verify Your Identity\",\"onboarding_verify_identity_label_account_opening_government_regulations\":\"Account Opening:\\nGovernment regulations require us to collect the following information from you.\",\"onboarding_verify_identity_label_annual_income\":\"Annual Income\",\"onboarding_verify_identity_label_birth_place\":\"Place of Bir