ave already set up a passkey for this device or security key.\",\"payment_add_cards__notification\":\"Your card {0} has been added\",\"payment_method__banner_cdc_methods_available\":\"Your Crypto.com payment methods are shared with OG.com.\",\"paypal_confirm__label_verification_pending\":\"Verification pending\",\"paypal_confirm__label_we_will_review\":\"We will review your details and update you soon\",\"paypal_deposit__label_pay_from\":\"Pay with\",\"paypal_error__label_authentication_error\":\"Authentication error\",\"paypal_error__label_invalid_country_code\":\"Your PayPal account could not be connected. Please try again with a PayPal account located in the US.\",\"paypal_error__label_your_paypal_account\":\"Your PayPal account could not be connected. Please check the details and try again.\",\"paypal_how_to_deposit\":\"How to deposit with PayPal\",\"paypal_tnc__label_continue\":\"Continue\",\"paypal_tnc__label_fee_and_limits\":\"Fees \u0026 Limits\",\"paypal_tnc__label_fee_description\":\"A {0}% fee is required to cover additional processing costs.\",\"paypal_tnc__label_fee_for_paypal\":\"{0}% Fee for PayPal\",\"paypal_tnc__label_i_understand\":\"I understand that a {0}% fee is required for every PayPal purchase.\",\"paypal_topup__button_max_amount\":\"Max ({0})\",\"perps__aria_back\":\"Back\",\"perps__aria_info\":\"More information\",\"perps__badge_waived\":\"Waived\",\"perps__button_add_margin\":\"Add margin\",\"perps__button_add_margin_banner\":\"Add margin\",\"perps__button_cancel_order\":\"Cancel order\",\"perps__button_close_position\":\"Close position\",\"perps__button_confirm\":\"Confirm\",\"perps__button_continue\":\"Continue\",\"perps__button_deposit\":\"Deposit\",\"perps__button_done\":\"Done\",\"perps__button_manage_positions\":\"Manage positions\",\"perps__button_modify\":\"Modify\",\"perps__button_not_now\":\"Not now\",\"perps__button_price_down\":\"Price down\",\"perps__button_price_up\":\"Price up\",\"perps__button_refresh\":\"Refresh\",\"perps__button_reset\":\"Reset\",\"perps__button_review_order\":\"Review Order\",\"perps__button_show_less\":\"Show less\",\"perps__button_show_more\":\"Show more\",\"perps__button_update_limit_price\":\"Update limit price\",\"perps__button_view_position\":\"View position\",\"perps__chart_stub\":\"Chart coming soon\",\"perps__confirmation_price_updated\":\"Price has been updated\",\"perps__confirmation_refreshing_price\":\"Refreshing price\",\"perps__description_approved\":\"You're ready to trade Perpetuals on crypto.\",\"perps__description_close_position\":\"This cannot be undone.\",\"perps__description_in_review\":\"Your information is under review. We'll let you know when you can start trading.\",\"perps__description_not_eligible\":\"Contact us for more information.\",\"perps__dialog_margin_required_body\":\"Your current position requires additional margin before you can place a new order. Recently added margin may take a moment to update.\",\"perps__dialog_margin_required_title\":\"Add margin to continue\",\"perps__dialog_position_closing_body\":\"This position is already being closed, so margin can no longer be added.\",\"perps__dialog_position_closing_title\":\"Position closing\",\"perps__dialog_position_liquidating_body\":\"This position is being liquidated, so margin can no longer be added.\",\"perps__dialog_position_liquidating_title\":\"Position liquidating\",\"perps__dialog_position_not_found_body\":\"This position is no longer open. Please check your open positions.\",\"perps__dialog_position_not_found_title\":\"Position unavailable\",\"perps__dialog_try_again_body\":\"Please contact us if the problem persists.\",\"perps__dialog_try_again_title\":\"Try again\",\"perps__direction_down\":\"Down\",\"perps__direction_up\":\"Up\",\"perps__edd_description_resubmit\":\"Your identity information could not be verified. Please try again.\",\"perps__edd_title_resubmit\":\"Resubmit Information\",\"perps__empty_no_open_orders\":\"No pending orders\",\"perps__empty_no_positions\":\"No positions\",\"perps__empty_no_transactions\":\"No transactions\",\"perps__error_cancel_order_body\":\"Please try again later\",\"perps__error_cancel_order_title\":\"Order could not be canceled\",\"perps__error_close_position_failed\":\"Couldn't close this position. Please try again.\",\"perps__error_close_position_preview_failed\":\"Couldn't load close details. Please try again.\",\"perps__error_could_not_load\":\"Could not be loaded\",\"perps__error_limit_price_above\":\"Limit price can't be above {price}\",\"perps__error_limit_price_below\":\"Limit price can't be below {price}\",\"perps__error_market_price_shifted_body\":\"The market price moved past your TP/SL before it could trigger. Adjust your TP/SL so it’s within a valid range of the current price.\",\"perps__error_market_price_shifted_cta\":\"Adjust now\",\"perps__error_market_price_shifted_title\":\"Market price shifted\",\"perps__error_sl_above_liquidation\":\"Stop-loss must be below the liquidation price.\",\"perps__error_sl_below_liquidation\":\"Stop-loss must be above the liquidation price.\",\"perps__error_sl_must_be_above_limit_price\":\"Stop-loss must be above the limit price.\",\"perps__error_sl_must_be_above_market_price\":\"Stop-loss must be above the market price.\",\"perps__error_sl_must_be_below_limit_price\":\"Stop-loss must be below the limit price.\",\"perps__error_sl_must_be_below_market_price\":\"Stop-loss must be below the market price.\",\"perps__error_sl_too_close_limit_price\":\"Stop-loss is too close to the limit price.\",\"perps__error_sl_too_close_liquidation\":\"Stop-loss is too close to the liquidation price.\",\"perps__error_sl_too_close_market_price\":\"Stop-loss is too close to the market price.\",\"perps__error_tp_must_be_above_limit_price\":\"Take-profit must be above the limit price.\",\"perps__error_tp_must_be_above_market_price\":\"Take-profit must be above the market price.\",\"perps__error_tp_must_be_below_limit_price\":\"Take-profit must be below the limit price.\",\"perps__error_tp_must_be_below_market_price\":\"Take-profit must be below the market price.\",\"perps__error_tp_sl_proximity_body\":\"Your Take profit or Stop loss must be at least 1% away from the current price. Move it further away to continue.\",\"perps__error_tp_sl_proximity_cta\":\"Adjust TP/SL\",\"perps__error_tp_sl_proximity_title\":\"Too close to current price\",\"perps__error_tp_too_close_limit_price\":\"Take-profit is too close to the limit price.\",\"perps__error_tp_too_close_market_price\":\"Take-profit is too close to the market price.\",\"perps__header_add_margin\":\"Add margin\",\"perps__header_confirm_margin\":\"Confirm margin addition\",\"perps__info_intro_body\":\"A perpetual future is a contract that tracks the price of an underlying asset, such as cryptocurrency. You do not own the underlying asset. Instead, you trade the direction of its price:\\n\\n • Price up: You gain if the price rises and lose if it falls\\n • Price down: You gain if the price falls and lose if it rises\\n\\nThe position stays open until you close it, or until it is closed for you because your margin has been used.\",\"perps__info_intro_title\":\"What are perps?\",\"perps__info_modify_tpsl_entire_position\":\"You’re updating the take-profit/stop-loss of your entire position\",\"perps__info_offer_1_body\":\"Capitalize on both rising and falling prices.\",\"perps__info_offer_1_title\":\"Profit potential in any market\",\"perps__info_offer_2_body\":\"Open larger positions with less capital.\",\"perps__info_offer_2_title\":\"Up to 5x leverage\",\"perps__info_offer_3_body\":\"Set take-profit and stop-loss to manage risk.\",\"perps__info_offer_3_title\":\"Set your exit points\",\"perps__info_section_title\":\"Why trade Perps?\",\"perps__info_title\":\"Perps\",\"perps__input_set_value\":\"Set value\",\"perps__intro_close\":\"Close\",\"perps__intro_cta_continue\":\"Continue\",\"perps__intro_subtitle\":\"Trade rising and falling prices on crypto. Up to 5x leverage. 0% fees for 30 days.\",\"perps__intro_title\":\"Introducing Perpetuals\",\"perps__label_24h\":\"24H\",\"perps__label_about\":\"About\",\"perps__label_all\":\"all\",\"perps__label_all_time\":\"all time\",\"perps__label_amount\":\"Amount\",\"perps__label_balance_amount\":\"Balance: {amount}\",\"perps__label_buy\":\"Buy\",\"perps__label_buy_at\":\"Buy at {price}\",\"perps__label_clear\":\"Clear\",\"perps__label_close\":\"Close\",\"perps__label_close_closing_at\":\"Current price\",\"perps__label_close_type\":\"Close type\",\"perps__label_close_type_manual\":\"Manual\",\"perps__label_completed\":\"Completed\",\"perps__label_current_price\":\"Current price: 1 {symbol} ≈ {price}\",\"perps__label_dangerous\":\"Dangerous\",\"perps__label_deficit_banner\":\"Your position needs additional margin\",\"perps__label_est_close_fee\":\"Est. trading fee\",\"perps__label_est_margin_required\":\"Est. margin required\",\"perps__label_est_pnl\":\"Est. P\u0026L:\",\"perps__label_estimated_amount\":\"Estimated amount\",\"perps__label_executed_amount\":\"Executed amount\",\"perps__label_executed_price\":\"Executed price\",\"perps__label_faq\":\"FAQ\",\"perps__label_filled\":\"Filled\",\"perps__label_filters\":\"Filters\",\"perps__label_free\":\"FREE\",\"perps__label_frequently_asked_questions\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"perps__label_history_title_close\":\"Close\",\"perps__label_history_title_dividend_paid\":\"Dividend paid\",\"perps__label_history_title_dividend_received\":\"Dividend received\",\"perps__label_history_title_funding_paid\":\"Funding fee paid\",\"perps__label_history_title_funding_received\":\"Funding fee received\",\"perps__label_history_title_limit_buy\":\"Limit Buy\",\"perps__label_history_title_limit_buy_direction\":\"Limit buy ({direction})\",\"perps__label_history_title_liquidation\":\"Liquidation\",\"perps__label_history_title_margin_added\":\"Margin added\",\"perps__label_history_title_market_buy\":\"Market Buy\",\"perps__label_history_title_market_buy_direction\":\"Market buy ({direction})\",\"perps__label_history_title_position_opened\":\"Position opened ({direction})\",\"perps__label_history_title_stop_loss\":\"Stop Loss\",\"perps__label_history_title_take_profit\":\"Take Profit\",\"perps__label_instrument_perp\":\"{name} Perp\",\"perps__label_insufficient_balance\":\"Add funds to continue\",\"perps__label_leverage\":\"Leverage\",\"perps__label_leverage_value\":\"{leverage} leverage\",\"perps__label_leveraged_size\":\"Leveraged size {amount}\",\"perps__label_leveraged_value\":\"Leveraged value\",\"perps__label_limit_order\":\"Limit Order\",\"perps__label_limit_price\":\"Limit price\",\"perps__label_limit_price_diff\":\"≈ {pct} from the current price\",\"perps__label_limit_price_over_current_price\":\"Limit price must be below the current price\",\"perps__label_liquidation\":\"Liquidation\",\"perps__label_liquidation_at\":\"Liquidation at {price}\",\"perps__label_liquidation_fee\":\"Liquidation fee\",\"perps__label_liquidation_price\":\"Liquidation price\",\"perps__label_liquidation_risk\":\"Liquidation risk\",\"perps__label_liquidation_warning\":\"Position nearing liquidation\",\"perps__label_liquidation_warning_body\":\"Add margin or close your position to reduce risk\",\"perps__label_margin\":\"Margin\",\"perps__label_margin_addition\":\"Margin addition\",\"perps__label_margin_balance\":\"Margin balance\",\"perps__label_margin_health\":\"Margin health\",\"perps__label_margin_returned\":\"Margin returned\",\"perps__label_market_data\":\"Market data\",\"perps__label_market_order\":\"Market Order\",\"perps__label_market_price\":\"Market price\",\"perps__label_max\":\"Max\",\"perps__label_max_leverage_value\":\"Max. {leverage}x leverage\",\"perps__label_max_order_value\":\"Max. order value is {value}\",\"perps__label_max_orders_reached\":\"Max. orders reached\",\"perps__label_max_position_value\":\"Max. position value {value}\",\"perps__label_max_positions_reached\":\"Max. 20 open positions reached\",\"perps__label_method\":\"Method\",\"perps__label_min_amount\":\"Min. amount {value}\",\"perps__label_min_margin_required\":\"Min. margin required is {value}\",\"perps__label_modify_tpsl\":\"Modify TPSL\",\"perps__label_modify_tpsl_body\":\"Adjust the take-profit or stop-loss\",\"perps__label_more_crypto_perps_coming\":\"More crypto perps coming soon\",\"perps__label_more_like\":\"More like {name} perps\",\"perps__label_more_stock_perps_coming\":\"More stock perps coming soon\",\"perps__label_new_liquidation_price\":\"Liquidation price\",\"perps__label_no_of_shares\":\"No. of shares\",\"perps__label_od_position\":\"Opened {direction} position\",\"perps__label_open\":\"Open\",\"perps__label_open_orders\":\"Open orders\",\"perps__label_order_amount\":\"Order amount\",\"perps__label_order_type\":\"Order type\",\"perps__label_order_value\":\"Order value\",\"perps__label_paid_with\":\"Paid with\",\"perps__label_past_1_hour\":\"past 1 hour\",\"perps__label_past_1_month\":\"past 1 month\",\"perps__label_past_1_week\":\"past 1 week\",\"perps__label_past_1_year\":\"past 1 year\",\"perps__label_past_24_hours\":\"past 24 hours\",\"perps__label_past_3_months\":\"past 3 months\",\"perps__label_past_6_months\":\"past 6 months\",\"perps__label_pct_from_current\":\"{pct} from the current price\",\"perps__label_pending_orders\":\"Pending orders\",\"perps__label_perpetual_margin_added\":\"Perp margin added\",\"perps__label_perpetual_order_canceled\":\"Perp order canceled\",\"perps__label_perpetual_order_failed\":\"Perp order failed\",\"perps__label_perpetual_order_placed\":\"Perp order placed\",\"perps__label_perpetual_position_closed\":\"Perp position closed\",\"perps__label_place_another_order\":\"Place another order\",\"perps__label_place_another_order_body\":\"Add to position size\",\"perps__label_pnl\":\"PnL:\",\"perps__label_pnl_abbr\":\"P\u0026L\",\"perps__label_position_leveraged_size\":\"Leveraged size\",\"perps__label_positions\":\"Positions\",\"perps__label_powered_by\":\"Powered by\",\"perps__label_predictions\":\"{symbol} Predictions\",\"perps__label_processed\":\"Processed\",\"perps__label_profit_loss\":\"Profit \u0026 loss\",\"perps__label_quantity_executed\":\"Quantity executed\",\"perps__label_realized_pnl\":\"Realized PnL\",\"perps__label_reconnecting\":\"Reconnecting to live data…\",\"perps__label_roi\":\"ROI\",\"perps__label_sell\":\"Sell\",\"perps__label_sell_at\":\"Sell at {price}\",\"perps__label_set_limit_price\":\"Set limit price\",\"perps__label_size\":\"Size\",\"perps__label_status_cautious\":\"Cautious\",\"perps__label_status_dangerous\":\"Dangerous\",\"perps__label_status_failed\":\"Failed\",\"perps__label_status_filled_pct\":\"{pct}% filled\",\"perps__label_status_filling\":\"Filling {pct}%\",\"perps__label_status_healthy\":\"Healthy\",\"perps__label_status_pending\":\"Pending\",\"perps__label_status_pending_cancel\":\"Pending cancel\",\"perps__label_stop_loss\":\"Stop loss\",\"perps__label_take_profit\":\"Take profit\",\"perps__label_take_profit_stop_loss\":\"Take profit / Stop loss\",\"perps__label_total_balance\":\"Total balance\",\"perps__label_total_cost\":\"Total cost\",\"perps__label_tp_sl\":\"TP/SL\",\"perps__label_trading_direction\":\"Trading direction\",\"perps__label_trading_fee\":\"Trading fee\",\"perps__label_transaction_date\":\"Transaction date\",\"perps__label_transaction_details\":\"Transaction details\",\"perps__label_transaction_id\":\"Transaction ID\",\"perps__label_transaction_id_copied\":\"Transaction ID copied to clipboard\",\"perps__label_transaction_n\":\"Transaction #{n}\",\"perps__label_transaction_type\":\"Transaction type\",\"perps__label_transactions\":\"Transactions\",\"perps__label_txn_detail_title_add_margin\":\"Add margin to {instrument} {direction}\",\"perps__label_txn_detail_title_close\":\"Close {instrument} {direction}\",\"perps__label_txn_detail_title_dividend_paid\":\"Dividend paid for {instrument}\",\"perps__label_txn_detail_title_dividend_received\":\"Dividend received for {instrument}\",\"perps__label_txn_detail_title_funding_paid\":\"Funding fee paid for {instrument}\",\"perps__label_txn_detail_title_funding_received\":\"Funding fee received for {instrument}\",\"perps__label_txn_detail_title_liquidation\":\"Liquidation {instrument} {direction}\",\"perps__label_txn_detail_title_open\":\"Open {instrument} {direction}\",\"perps__label_txn_detail_title_stop_loss\":\"Stop Loss {instrument} {direction}\",\"perps__label_txn_detail_title_take_profit\":\"Take Profit {instrument} {direction}\",\"perps__label_unrealized_pnl\":\"Unrealized profit \u0026 loss\",\"perps__label_unrealized_pnl_roi\":\"Unrealized PNL (ROI)\",\"perps__label_unrealized_roi\":\"Unrealized ROI\",\"perps__label_you_get\":\"You get\",\"perps__label_you_pay\":\"You pay\",\"perps__label_your_position\":\"Your position\",\"perps__label_your_positions\":\"Your positions\",\"perps__label_ytd\":\"YTD\",\"perps__loading_processing\":\"Processing\",\"perps__manage_dialog_cancel_desc\":\"If you cancel while the upcoming purchase is in progress, the upcoming purchase will still be executed. Other future purchases will be cancelled.\",\"perps__manage_dialog_cancel_title\":\"Confirm cancellation\",\"perps__manage_dialog_close_desc\":\"Closing this position will realize its current PnL. This action cannot be undone.\",\"perps__manage_dialog_close_title\":\"Confirm close\",\"perps__manage_title_buy_open\":\"Buy {name} Perpetual\",\"perps__manage_title_position\":\"{name} Perpetual\",\"perps__manage_title_sell_open\":\"Sell {name} Perpetual\",\"perps__market_field_24h_change\":\"24H change\",\"perps__market_field_24h_volume\":\"24H volume\",\"perps__market_field_expiry_date\":\"Expiry date\",\"perps__market_field_funding_rate\":\"Funding rate\",\"perps__market_field_funding_rate_body\":\"A small payment between longs and shorts for Perpetuals, typically made every 8 hours.\\n\\nIt keeps the contract price aligned with the spot price.\\n\\nWhen the contract trades above spot, longs pay shorts, and vice versa.\\n\\nThis is paid between traders, not to the platform.\",\"perps__market_field_index_price\":\"Index price\",\"perps__market_field_index_price_body\":\"The current spot price of the underlying asset.\\n\\nIt's averaged across major exchanges, and the mark price tracks it.\\n\\nWhen the mark price and index price drift apart, the funding rate realigns them.\",\"perps__market_field_mark_price\":\"Mark price\",\"perps__market_field_mark_price_body\":\"The estimated fair value of your contract.\\n\\nIt determines your profit or loss and liquidation level.\\n\\nIt uses an average rather than a single price, so brief spikes don't affect your trade unfairly.\",\"perps__market_field_max_leverage\":\"Max. leverage\",\"perps__market_field_next_funding\":\"Next funding\",\"perps__market_field_open_interest\":\"Open interest\",\"perps__market_field_open_interest_body\":\"The total number of open contracts in a market.\\n\\nIt increases as new positions open and decreases as they close.\\n\\nHigher open interest generally means more liquidity.\",\"perps__markets_empty\":\"No markets available\",\"perps__metadata_description\":\"Trade perpetual futures contracts with leverage on OG. Access crypto and sports perpetuals with real-time pricing.\",\"perps__metadata_title\":\"Perpetual Futures Trading | OG\",\"perps__note_fees_waived_until\":\"Fees waived until {date}\",\"perps__onboarding_body_zero_fees\":\"Trade CFTC-margined perpetuals with zero trading fees for a limited time.\",\"perps__onboarding_body_zero_fees_30_days\":\"Answer a few verification questions to activate Perps trading on stocks and crypto. Fees waived for 30 days.\",\"perps__onboarding_fallback_description\":\"Answer a few verification questions to activate Perps trading.\",\"perps__onboarding_fallback_title\":\"Trade crypto perps up to 5x leverage\",\"perps__onboarding_title_zero_fees\":\"Trade Perpetuals with 0% fees\",\"perps__onboarding_title_zero_fees_30_days\":\"Zero-fee Perps trading for 30 days\",\"perps__order_type_limit\":\"Limit\",\"perps__order_type_market\":\"Market\",\"perps__position_sheet_desc_leverage\":\"The total market value of your position, including leverage.\",\"perps__position_sheet_desc_margin\":\"The amount backing your current position, calculated by your collateral and any unrealized profit or loss. Each position holds its own margin.\\n\\nIt is not the same as position size, which is the full leveraged value.\\n\\nMargin balance increases when your trade is in profit or you add margin. It decreases when your trade is at a loss, or when fees and funding are charged.\",\"perps__position_sheet_desc_settlement\":\"Your position is marked to the current market price at each settlement cycle that happens two times per business day. The gain or loss since the last mark will be credited to or debited from your margin balance.\",\"perps__position_sheet_desc_total_pnl\":\"The sum of your unrealized and realized P\u0026L for this position.\",\"perps__position_sheet_desc_unrealized_realized\":\"^[Unrealized P\u0026L:](font: 'body_emphasis') Your position's value at market price before settlement.\\n\\n^[Realized P\u0026L:](font: 'body_emphasis') Profit or loss already settled to your margin balance.\",\"perps__position_sheet_label_realized\":\"Realized P\u0026L\",\"perps__position_sheet_label_total_pnl\":\"Total P\u0026L\",\"perps__position_sheet_label_unrealized\":\"Unrealized P\u0026L\",\"perps__position_sheet_title_leverage\":\"Leveraged size\",\"perps__position_sheet_title_margin\":\"Margin balance\",\"perps__position_sheet_title_pnl\":\"Profit \u0026 loss\",\"perps__result_close\":\"Close\",\"perps__result_closed_continue\":\"Continue\",\"perps__result_closed_direction\":\"Price {direction} {leverage}x\",\"perps__result_closed_subtitle\":\"{instrument}\",\"perps__result_closed_success\":\"Close order submitted\",\"perps__result_continue\":\"Continue\",\"perps__result_cost_label\":\"Cost\",\"perps__result_direction_down\":\"down\",\"perps__result_direction_up\":\"up\",\"perps__result_do_later\":\"Do it later\",\"perps__result_go_to_positions\":\"Go to Positions\",\"perps__result_leveraged_size\":\"Leveraged size\",\"perps__result_limit_order_placed\":\"Limit order placed\",\"perps__result_limit_reaches\":\"When price reaches {price}\\nwith margin of {margin}\",\"perps__result_loading_almost\":\"Almost there\",\"perps__result_loading_placing\":\"Placing your order\",\"perps__result_margin_added\":\"{amount} margin added\",\"perps__result_margin_direction\":\"Price {direction} {leverage}x\",\"perps__result_margin_settling\":\"This may take a moment to update\",\"perps__result_order_failed\":\"Order failed\",\"perps__result_order_pending\":\"Order pending\",\"perps__result_pending_body\":\"Your order is pending.\",\"perps__result_perps\":\"PERPS\",\"perps__result_position_opened\":\"Position opened\",\"perps__result_price_down\":\"Price down\",\"perps__result_price_label\":\"Price\",\"perps__result_price_up\":\"Price up\",\"perps__result_rejected_body\":\"Your order was unsuccessful.\\nPlease try again.\",\"perps__result_share_label\":\"Share your trade\",\"perps__result_time_label\":\"Time\",\"perps__result_tpsl_modified_successfully\":\"TPSL modified successfully\",\"perps__result_tpsl_modify_failed\":\"TPSL could not be modified\",\"perps__result_tpsl_modify_failed_subtitle\":\"Please try again\",\"perps__result_tpsl_price_down\":\"Price down {leverage}\",\"perps__result_tpsl_price_up\":\"Price up {leverage}\",\"perps__result_try_again\":\"Try again\",\"perps__segment_dollar_pnl\":\"$$ PnL\",\"perps__segment_pct_pnl\":\"% PnL\",\"perps__segment_price\":\"Price\",\"perps__share_label_cost\":\"Cost\",\"perps__share_label_current_price\":\"Current price\",\"perps__share_label_direction\":\"Direction\",\"perps__share_label_entry_price\":\"Entry price\",\"perps__share_label_leveraged_size\":\"Leveraged size\",\"perps__share_label_limit_price\":\"Limit price\",\"perps__share_label_pnl_percentage\":\"P\u0026L%\",\"perps__sheet_learn_more\":\"Learn more\",\"perps__sheet_leverage_body\":\"Leverage lets you control a larger position with less capital. Your margin is multiplied by your chosen leverage to determine your position size.\\n\\nFor example, $100 at 5x leverage opens a $500 position. Both potential gains and losses are amplified by 5x.\",\"perps__sheet_leverage_title\":\"Leverage\",\"perps__sheet_liquidation_body\":\"The market price at which your position is automatically closed to prevent losses exceeding your margin.\\n\\nTo lower your liquidation risk, you can reduce leverage or add margin to your position. price is the market price at which your position gets automatically closed to prevent losses exceeding your margin.\",\"perps__sheet_liquidation_title\":\"Liquidation price\",\"perps__sheet_new_liq_price_body\":\"The price at which your position is automatically closed. This happens when the market moves far enough against you that your margin can no longer cover the losses.\\n\\nThe higher your leverage, the closer your liquidation price is to your entry price.\",\"perps__sheet_new_liq_price_title\":\"Liquidation price\",\"perps__sheet_order_value_body\":\"The total value of your trade after leverage.\\n\\nTo manage risk, you can set take-profit and stop-loss levels to automatically exit your trade at a price of your choice.\",\"perps__sheet_order_value_title\":\"Order value\",\"perps__sheet_trading_fee_body\":\"Trading fees are comprised of a DCM transaction fee, a DCO clearing fee and FCM fees, including associated commission.\",\"perps__sheet_trading_fee_title\":\"Trading fee\",\"perps__subtitle_perpetual_futures_live\":\"Perpetual futures are live. Predict markets with leverage.\",\"perps__tab_overview\":\"Overview\",\"perps__tab_positions\":\"Positions\",\"perps__tab_summary\":\"Summary\",\"perps__tab_transactions\":\"Transactions\",\"perps__title_approved\":\"You're in\",\"perps__title_close_position\":\"Close position\",\"perps__title_confirm_order\":\"Confirm {symbol} Perpetual\",\"perps__title_in_review\":\"We're on it\",\"perps__title_manage_orders\":\"Manage Perpetuals \u0026 Futures Orders\",\"perps__title_not_eligible\":\"You're not eligible\",\"perps__title_perp_direction\":\"{name} • {direction}\",\"perps__title_perpetuals\":\"Perps\",\"perps__title_position_details\":\"Position details\",\"perps__title_tp_sl\":\"Take Profit \u0026 Stop loss\",\"perps__title_trade_perpetuals\":\"Trade Perpetuals on OG\",\"perps__tooltip_instant_deposit\":\"Instant Deposit can't be used for perpetual trading until the funds are settled.\",\"perps__tpsl__banner_after_fill\":\"We'll update take-profit \u0026 stop-loss for the entire position after this order fills.\",\"perps__tpsl__banner_pending_limit_order\":\"You have a pending order with take-profit \u0026 stop-loss. Saving here updates TP/SL on your current position now, and replaces any TP/SL set with that order.\",\"perps__tutorial_body_page_1\":\"5x leverage turns $50 into $250 of exposure. Start at $5.\",\"perps__tutorial_body_page_2\":\"Think a crypto is rising? Go long. Think it's falling? Go short.\",\"perps__tutorial_body_page_3\":\"Set a stop-loss so you never lose more than you're comfortable with\",\"perps__tutorial_button_continue\":\"Continue\",\"perps__tutorial_button_skip\":\"Skip\",\"perps__tutorial_legal_learn_more\":\"Learn more\",\"perps__tutorial_title_page_1\":\"Amplify trades by up to 5x\",\"perps__tutorial_title_page_2\":\"Profit potential however prices move\",\"perps__tutorial_title_page_3\":\"You decide your risk level\",\"perps__value_market_price\":\"= {price}\",\"perps_faq__funding_rate_a\":\"It's the fee exchanged between traders every eight hours (00:00, 08:00, 16:00 UTC) to keep contract prices close to the spot price of the underlying asset.\\n\\nYou only pay or receive the fee if you have an open position at those times.\\n\\n^[Positive rate:](font: 'body_emphasis') Contract price is above spot price. Long positions pay short positions, pulling the contract price back down.\\n\\n^[Negative rate:](font: 'body_emphasis') Contract price is below spot price. Short positions pay long positions, pushing the contract price back up.\",\"perps_faq__funding_rate_q\":\"How does the funding rate work?\",\"perps_faq__liquidation_a\":\"Liquidation occurs when your margin balance reaches the maintenance margin (the minimum to keep a position open).\\n\\nWhen your margin health hits zero, your position is automatically closed at the liquidation price to stop further losses. Each position holds its own margin, so only the at-risk position is closed.\\n\\nYou'll receive warnings as you approach liquidation. To prevent it, add margin or close the position yourself.\",\"perps_faq__liquidation_q\":\"How does liquidation work?\",\"perps_faq__what_is_a\":\"A perpetual future is a contract that tracks the price of an underlying asset, such as cryptocurrency or a listed stock. You do not own the underlying asset. Instead, you trade the direction of its price:\\n\\n^[Price up:](font: 'body_emphasis') You gain if the price rises and lose if it falls\\n\\n^[Price down:](font: 'body_emphasis') You gain if the price falls and lose if it rises\\n\\nThe position stays open until you close it, or until it is closed for you because your margin has been used.\",\"perps_faq__what_is_q\":\"What are perps?\",\"pgw__3ds_declined\":\"The payment declined due to Strong Customer Authentication (3DS). Please retry with the same card or use a different card.\",\"pgw__3ds_declined_message_key\":\"The payment declined due to Strong Customer Authentication (3DS). Please retry with the same card or use a different card.\",\"pgw__bank_declined\":\"The payment has been declined by your bank. Please retry with the same card or use a different card.\",\"pgw__bank_declined_message_key\":\"The payment has been declined by your bank. Please retry with the same card or use a different card.\",\"pgw__card_expired\":\"Your card is expired. Please check your card details and try again with a different card.\",\"pgw__card_expired_message_key\":\"Your card is expired. Please check your card details and try again with a different card.\",\"pgw__credit_card_not_allowed\":\"We don't accept credit cards for top-ups. Please use a debit card or try a different method.\",\"pgw__credit_card_not_allowed_message_key\":\"We don't accept credit cards for top-ups. Please use a debit card or try a different method.\",\"pgw__credit_card_not_allowed_title_key\":\"Invalid Card Details\",\"pgw__geo_restricted\":\"We only accept cards issued in the same country as your account. Please use a locally issued card to complete your top-up.\",\"pgw__geo_restricted_message_key\":\"We only accept cards issued in the same country as your account. Please use a locally issued card to complete your top-up.\",\"pgw__geo_restricted_title_key\":\"Invalid Card Details\",\"pgw__incorrect_payment_info\":\"The payment has been declined. Please check your card details and try again.\",\"pgw__incorrect_payment_info_message_key\":\"The payment has been declined. Please check your card details and try again.\",\"pgw__insufficient_balance\":\"The payment has been declined due to insufficient balance. Please ensure enough balance in your card or try a different card.\",\"pgw__insufficient_balance_message_key\":\"The payment has been declined due to insufficient balance. Please ensure enough balance in your card or try a different card.\",\"pgw__invalid_card\":\"Please verify your card details and re-submit your request.\",\"pgw__invalid_card_message_key\":\"Please verify your card details and re-submit your request.\",\"pgw__ma2005_2013\":\"An error occurred while processing your request. Error Code: MA2005-2013\",\"pgw__ma2005_2013_message_key\":\"An error occurred while processing your request. Error Code: MA2005-2013\",\"pgw__ma2005_2014\":\"An error occurred while processing your request. Error Code: MA2005-2014\",\"pgw__ma2005_2014_message_key\":\"An error occurred while processing your request. Error Code: MA2005-2014\",\"pgw__ma2005_2015\":\"An error occurred while processing your request. Error Code: MA2005-2015\",\"pgw__ma2005_2015_message_key\":\"An error occurred while processing your request. Error Code: MA2005-2015\",\"pgw__ma2005_2016\":\"An error occurred while processing your request. Error Code: MA2005-2016\",\"pgw__ma2005_2016_message_key\":\"An error occurred while processing your request. Error Code: MA2005-2016\",\"pgw__payment_declined\":\"The payment has been declined. Please retry with the same card or use a different card.\",\"pgw__payment_declined_message_key\":\"The payment has been declined. Please retry with the same card or use a different card.\",\"pgw__payment_expired\":\"The payment has expired due to inactivity. Please retry with the same card or use a different card.\",\"pgw__payment_expired_message_key\":\"The payment has expired due to inactivity. Please retry with the same card or use a different card.\",\"pgw__sg_cc_not_supported_4_add_card\":\"To comply with regulations, Singapore credit cards are not supported. Please use a debit card instead.\",\"pgw__sg_cc_not_supported_4_add_card_message_key\":\"To comply with regulations, Singapore credit cards are not supported. Please use a debit card instead.\",\"pgw__sg_cc_not_supported_4_add_card_title_key\":\"Unable to Add Card.\",\"pgw__sg_cc_not_supported_4_payment\":\"In compliance with regulations, Singapore credit cards are not supported for crypto purchases. Please use a debit card instead.\",\"pgw__sg_cc_not_supported_4_payment_message_key\":\"In compliance with regulations, Singapore credit cards are not supported for crypto purchases. Please use a debit card instead.\",\"pgw__sg_cc_not_supported_4_payment_title_key\":\"Credit card not supported\",\"pgw__technical_failed\":\"The payment failed due to a technical issue. Please try again later.\",\"pgw__technical_failed_message_key\":\"The payment failed due to a technical issue. Please try aga