led\",\"portfolio_transaction_status_event_canceled\":\"Event Canceled\",\"portfolio_transaction_status_event_tied\":\"Event Tied\",\"portfolio_transaction_status_filled\":\"Filled\",\"portfolio_transaction_status_filled_count\":\"{tradeQuantity} filled\",\"portfolio_transaction_status_filled_ratio\":\"{tradeQuantity}/{sentQuantity} filled\",\"portfolio_transaction_status_partially_filled\":\"Partially filled\",\"portfolio_transaction_status_pending\":\"Pending\",\"portfolio_transaction_status_rejected\":\"Rejected\",\"portfolio_transaction_status_submitted\":\"Submitted\",\"position__detail__avg_entry_price\":\"Avg. price\",\"position__detail__boost_applied\":\"Applied\",\"position__detail__boost_status\":\"Boost status\",\"position__detail__buy_more\":\"Trade more\",\"position__detail__cash_out\":\"Cash out\",\"position__detail__current_price\":\"Current price\",\"position__detail__current_value\":\"Current value\",\"position__detail__current_value_tooltip\":\"This is your position's current value (including the used bonus) if you cash out now. It is calculated using live odds, if available.\",\"position__detail__error_loading\":\"Detail is unavailable\",\"position__detail__market\":\"Market\",\"position__detail__quantity\":\"Quantity\",\"position__detail__realized_pnl\":\"Realized PnL\",\"position__detail__realized_pnl_tooltip\":\"Your net profit or loss, including fees.\",\"position__detail__result\":\"Result\",\"position__detail__title\":\"Position details\",\"position__detail__to_be_determined\":\"To be determined\",\"position__detail__to_win\":\"Max payout\",\"position__detail__total_bought\":\"Total paid\",\"position__detail__total_bought_tooltip\":\"The total amount you've paid to open this position, including fees and any bonuses applied.\",\"position__detail__total_cost\":\"Total cost\",\"position__detail__total_received\":\"Total received\",\"position__detail__trade_more_added\":\"Added to trade slip\",\"position__detail__unrealized_pnl\":\"Unrealized PnL\",\"position__detail__unrealized_pnl_tooltip\":\"Your potential profit or loss if you close your position now, excluding fees.\",\"position__detail__voucher_applied\":\"Coupon applied\",\"position__detail__voucher_applied_tooltip\":\"Bonus money used for this position. It becomes real, withdrawable cash when the position settles as a win.\",\"position__detail__voucher_bonuses\":\"{amount} Bonus\",\"position__detail__voucher_rebate\":\"{amount} Rebate\",\"predict__l2__all\":\"All\",\"predict__l2__all_durations\":\"All\",\"predict__l2__duration\":\"Duration\",\"prediction__label_closed_order\":\"Prediction: Closed order\",\"prediction__label_event_tied\":\"Prediction: Event tied\",\"prediction__label_learn_more\":\"Learn more\",\"prediction__label_no\":\"No\",\"prediction__label_open_order\":\"Prediction: Open order\",\"prediction__label_void\":\"Prediction: Event canceled\",\"prediction__label_yes\":\"Yes\",\"prediction__transaction_close_order\":\"Prediction: Close order\",\"prediction__transaction_open_order\":\"Prediction: Open order\",\"prediction__transaction_order_executed\":\"Order executed\",\"prediction__transaction_order_placed\":\"Order placed\",\"prediction__transaction_order_returned\":\"Order returned\",\"prediction__transaction_reward\":\"Reward credited\",\"prediction__transaction_reward_reversal\":\"Reward clawback\",\"prediction_quiz__contract_expires_worthless_label\":\"You invest $100 in Prediction Market contracts linked to the possibility of a major increase in the oil price. The event does not occur and the contracts expire worthless. What is the most likely outcome?\",\"prediction_quiz__contract_expires_worthless_selection_1\":\"You lose the $100 invested in those contracts\",\"prediction_quiz__contract_expires_worthless_selection_2\":\"You receive your $100 back automatically\",\"prediction_quiz__contract_expires_worthless_selection_3\":\"The contract price adjusts based on market sentiment after expiry\",\"prediction_quiz__contract_price_meaning_label\":\"If a Prediction Market contract trades at $0.70, what does this generally represent?\",\"prediction_quiz__contract_price_meaning_selection_1\":\"The market’s current implied expectation that the event may occur, which is not guaranteed and may change\",\"prediction_quiz__contract_price_meaning_selection_2\":\"The contract will pay $70, regardless of the outcome\",\"prediction_quiz__contract_price_meaning_selection_3\":\"The maximum payout is always $0.70\",\"prediction_quiz__contract_primary_use_label\":\"What are Prediction Market contracts primarily used for?\",\"prediction_quiz__contract_primary_use_selection_1\":\"Taking an investment position on the outcome of a future event\",\"prediction_quiz__contract_primary_use_selection_2\":\"Guaranteeing investment returns\",\"prediction_quiz__contract_primary_use_selection_3\":\"Protecting clients against all investment losses\",\"prediction_quiz__main_risk_label\":\"Which statement best describes the main risk of investing in Prediction Market contracts?\",\"prediction_quiz__main_risk_selection_1\":\"You may lose all the amount you invested in the contract\",\"prediction_quiz__main_risk_selection_2\":\"Returns are guaranteed if you hold the contract until expiry\",\"prediction_quiz__main_risk_selection_3\":\"You cannot lose money because the outcome is known in advance\",\"prediction_quiz__price_change_new_info_label\":\"If you hold a Prediction Market contract linked to a pending central bank decision, and new information changes public expectations, what is most likely to happen to the contract price?\",\"prediction_quiz__price_change_new_info_selection_1\":\"The price may change based on updated market expectations\",\"prediction_quiz__price_change_new_info_selection_2\":\"The price will remain fixed until the event occurs\",\"prediction_quiz__price_change_new_info_selection_3\":\"The contract will be cancelled automatically\",\"prediction_quiz__price_rise_meaning_label\":\"A Prediction Market contract linked to changes in the employment rate rises from $0.30 to $0.60 in one day. What does this most likely reflect?\",\"prediction_quiz__price_rise_meaning_selection_1\":\"Increased market belief that the event may occur\",\"prediction_quiz__price_rise_meaning_selection_2\":\"A guaranteed double payout\",\"prediction_quiz__price_rise_meaning_selection_3\":\"A guaranteed $0.30 profit for every client\",\"prediction_quiz__realise_loss_label\":\"A week ago you bought a Prediction Market contract for $0.65. The contract will pay $1 if quarterly the GDP growth exceeds 2%. Today, new data suggests weaker growth and the contract price falls to $0.25. Which statement best describes how you could realise a loss today?\",\"prediction_quiz__realise_loss_selection_1\":\"You realise a loss if you sell the contract today at $0.25\",\"prediction_quiz__realise_loss_selection_2\":\"You realise a loss only if GDP growth is below 2% at expiry\",\"prediction_quiz__realise_loss_selection_3\":\"You have already realised a loss because the market price dropped\",\"prediction_quiz_intro__button_start\":\"Continue\",\"prediction_quiz_intro__content\":\"This is not investment advice. You should consider your own financial circumstances and, if needed, seek independent professional advice. If a product appears not appropriate for you, we may show a risk warning or limit your access.\\n\\nBy continuing you confirm that you understand the above and will provide accurate information.\",\"prediction_quiz_intro__subtitle\":\"This helps us assess whether our products are appropriate for you, based on your knowledge, experience and risk appetite. Please answer honestly.\",\"prediction_quiz_intro__title\":\"Appropriateness Assessment\",\"prediction_quiz_result__button_continue\":\"Continue\",\"prediction_quiz_result__button_retake\":\"Retake\",\"prediction_quiz_result__checkbox_acknowledge\":\"I acknowledge the notice above\",\"prediction_quiz_result__label_failed_content\":\"Based on your responses, we have determined that this product may not be appropriate for you, as it carries a high level of risk.\\n\\nWe strongly recommend that you do not proceed unless you fully understand the risks involved. If you wish to continue, you will do so at your own risk.\",\"prediction_quiz_result__label_passed\":\"You’re all set\",\"prediction_quiz_result__label_passed_content\":\"Welcome to OG.com! We’re here to support your journey every step of the way.\",\"prediction_quiz_result__label_score\":\"Your score: {0}/{1}\",\"prediction_quiz_result__label_warning_notice\":\"Warning notice\",\"profile__a11y_more\":\"More\",\"profile__button_add_to_trade_slip\":\"Add to trade slip\",\"profile__button_buy\":\"Buy\",\"profile__button_compose\":\"Compose\",\"profile__button_edit_profile\":\"Edit Profile\",\"profile__button_follow\":\"Follow\",\"profile__button_following\":\"Following\",\"profile__button_notifications\":\"Notifications\",\"profile__button_report\":\"Report\",\"profile__button_share\":\"Share\",\"profile__button_view_event\":\"View event\",\"profile__button_view_parlay\":\"View combo\",\"profile__empty_no_trades\":\"No recent trades.\",\"profile__empty_start_making_predictions\":\"Start making predictions — they'll show up here.\",\"profile__empty_visibility_limited\":\"This user has set their profile visibility to Limited.\",\"profile__empty_visibility_minimum\":\"This user has set their profile visibility to Minimum.\",\"profile__label_followers\":\"Followers\",\"profile__label_following\":\"Following\",\"profile__label_joined\":\"Joined {date}\",\"profile__label_new_trades\":\"New Trades\",\"profile__label_paid_out\":\"Paid out\",\"profile__label_profile_privacy\":\"Profile Privacy\",\"profile__label_profit_loss\":\"Profit / Loss\",\"profile__label_return\":\"Return\",\"profile__label_total_cost\":\"Total cost\",\"profile__label_trades\":\"{count, plural, one {# Trade} other {# Trades}}\",\"profile__label_visibility_full\":\"Full\",\"profile__label_visibility_l