is an event contract that is a derivatives product offered by North American Derivatives Exchange, Inc. (NADEX), a CFTC-regulated exchange, which does business under the brand OG.com Prediction Markets (OG.com) and uses OG.com technology. Trading on OG.com involves risk and may not be appropriate for all.\",\"web_auth_common_footer_disclaimer_eea_row\":\"Foris Capital MU Limited is authorised as an investment dealer and regulated by the Financial Services Commission Mauritius. Foris Capital MU Limited provides access to event contracts, which are complex derivatives products, which are listed by North American Derivatives Exchange, Inc. (\\\"NADEX\\\"), a U.S. CFTC-registered exchange, via connection to Foris DAX FCM LLC, a CFTC-registered Futures Commission Merchant, using OG.com technology. Trading on OG.com involves risk and may not be appropriate for all.\",\"web_auth_common_login\":\"Log in\",\"web_auth_common_og\":\"OG.com\",\"web_auth_common_privacyNotice\":\"privacy notice\",\"web_auth_common_privacyNoticeInfo\":\"By submitting your email, you confirm you've read the relevant \u003cprivacy\u003e\u003c/privacy\u003e.\",\"web_auth_common_support\":\"Support\",\"web_auth_connect_benefit_fast_track_description\":\"Set up your OG.com account with your Crypto.com account details\",\"web_auth_connect_benefit_fast_track_title\":\"Fast-track setup\",\"web_auth_connect_benefit_one_login_description\":\"Use your existing Crypto.com credentials to log in\",\"web_auth_connect_benefit_one_login_title\":\"One login\",\"web_auth_connect_benefit_shared_wallet_description\":\"Access to Crypto.com balance and payment methods\",\"web_auth_connect_benefit_shared_wallet_title\":\"Shared wallet\",\"web_auth_connect_description_fallback_account\":\"your existing account.\",\"web_auth_connect_description_prefix\":\"OG.com is powered by Crypto.com and we found your existing account:\",\"web_auth_connect_title\":\"Welcome, Crypto.com user!\",\"web_auth_createPasscode_confirmPasscode\":\"Confirm Passcode\",\"web_auth_createPasscode_createPasscode\":\"Create Passcode\",\"web_auth_createPasscode_createPasscodeDesc\":\"You will use this passcode to log in, unlock your account, and confirm transactions.\",\"web_auth_createPasscode_passcodeNotMatch\":\"Passcode do not match\",\"web_auth_emailVerify_descForEmailOTP\":\"Enter the 6-digit code sent to \u003cemail\u003e\u003c/email\u003e\",\"web_auth_emailVerify_resendDesc\":\"Resend code ({seconds}s)\",\"web_auth_emailVerify_verifyEmailAddress\":\"Verify email address\",\"web_auth_email_input__button_continue\":\"Continue\",\"web_auth_error_captcha_verification_failed_with_suggestion\":\"The Captcha verification failed. Please try using a different network or device.\",\"web_auth_error_checkYourPhoneNumberAndCountryCode\":\"Please check your phone number and country code, then try again.\",\"web_auth_error_cooldown\":\"Too many attempts. Please try again after {seconds} seconds.\",\"web_auth_error_incorrectPasscode\":\"Incorrect passcode. Please try again.\",\"web_auth_error_invalidCode\":\"Invalid code\",\"web_auth_error_invalidCodeWithDetails\":\"Incorrect code. The account will be locked for {minutes} minutes after {attempts} failed attempts.\",\"web_auth_error_invalidReferralCode\":\"Invalid referral code\",\"web_auth_error_rateLimitExceeded\":\"Too many attempts. Please try again after {time} minutes.\",\"web_auth_error_request_timeout\":\"Request timeout.\",\"web_auth_error_serviceRestricted\":\"Unfortunately we cannot offer {source} services to you for the time being, due to market regulations.\",\"web_auth_error_somethingWentWrong\":\"Something went wrong.\",\"web_auth_identity_onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_hard_fail_content\":\"We regret to inform you that your account registration is unsuccessful. This may be due to one of the following reasons:\",\"web_auth_identity_onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_hard_fail_footer\":\"Please contact us if you have questions.\",\"web_auth_identity_onboarding_revamp