e Over\",\"web_market__order_book_trade_team\":\"Trade {team}\",\"web_market__order_book_trade_under\":\"Trade Under\",\"web_market__order_book_trade_yes\":\"Trade Yes\",\"web_market__order_book_under\":\"Under\",\"web_market__order_book_yes\":\"Yes\",\"web_market__recurring_disclaimer\":\"Trading in short-duration markets involves substantial risk. Past performance does not guarantee future results.\",\"web_market__recurring_volume_disclaimer_composition\":\"The trading volume displayed on this page is a composite figure. It includes (i) historical trading volume from OG.com's prior 20-minute and 2-hour recurring contracts, which are no longer actively listed, and (ii) trading volume generated by the current 15-minute and 1-hour recurring contracts.\",\"web_market__recurring_volume_disclaimer_purpose\":\"This combined display is provided to give users a broader view of trading activity across contract types with similar underlying events. The displayed volume does not represent trading activity attributable solely to the contract shown on this page.\",\"web_market__title_chat\":\"Chat\",\"web_market__title_how_it_works\":\"Market Rules\",\"web_market__title_more_events_like_this\":\"More events like this\",\"web_market__title_more_in_other_categories\":\"More in other categories\",\"web_market__title_more_in_this_event\":\"More in this event\",\"web_market__title_order_book\":\"Order book\",\"web_market__title_trending_markets\":\"Trending Markets\",\"web_market__title_you_might_be_interested\":\"You Might Be Interested\",\"web_market__toast_failed_to_copy\":\"Failed to copy to clipboard\",\"web_market__toast_link_copied\":\"Link copied\",\"web_mfa_verification__label_enter_the_verification_code\":\"Enter the verification code generated by your authenticator app\",\"web_mfa_verification__label_paste\":\"Paste\",\"web_nav__aria_category_navigation\":\"Category navigation\",\"web_nav__aria_navigation_menu\":\"Navigation menu\",\"web_nav__collapse_section_aria\":\"Col