 need to update your phone, you can restore 2FA if you saved the secret seed provided when setting up your 2FA device.\",\"web_settings__description_account_settings\":\"Manage your profile and security \u0026 privacy settings for your OG.com trading account.\",\"web_settings__description_anti_phishing_code\":\"Your unique code will appear in all genuine OG.com emails to help you spot phishing attempts\",\"web_settings__description_anti_phishing_update_hint\":\"For added protection, update your code every 30 days.\",\"web_settings__description_disable_2fa_warning\":\"Disabling 2FA will affect Manage Bank Account.\\n\\nYou will need your passcode and 2FA code to proceed. Disabling 2FA will not revoke your registered authentication key. Please keep it secure.\\n\\nFor more details on resetting 2FA, please visit \u003cpage\u003ethis page\u003c/page\u003e.\",\"web_settings__description_enable_2fa_requirement\":\"As an extra security measure, you are required to enable 2-Factor Authentication (2FA) for withdrawals and whitelisting wallet addresses.\\n\\n2FA adds another layer of security to passcode or biometric authentication. Once enabled, you will be required to provide your 2FA code when performing certain actions in OG.com.\",\"web_settings__description_notification_email_disclaimer\":\"We only email when it matters — relevant updates, highlights, and campaigns. No spam.\",\"web_settings__description_notification_push_disclaimer\":\"Stay in the loop with real-time alerts for markets, orders, important updates and offers.\",\"web_settings__description_passkey_security\":\"For security reasons, only passkeys created from 15 August 2024 onwards can be used on OG.com Web. Create a new passkey to use it across your OG.com accounts.\",\"web_settings__description_personal_info_edit\":\"You can edit your personal information in the Crypto.com App.\",\"web_settings__description_quick_trade_amounts\":\"Customize preset amounts to speed up your trades.\",\"web_settings__description_reset_2fa_contact_support\":\"If you want to reset 2FA, please contact customer support.\",\"web_settings__description_withdrawal_lock\":\"It must be enabled for you to be eligible for the \u003cprogram\u003eAccount Protection Programme\u003c/program\u003e, if applicable. Disabling the feature takes 24 hours to go into effect.\",\"web_settings__description_withdrawal_lock_disable\":\"24-Hour Withdrawal Lock is being disabled, which takes 24 hours to go into effect\",\"web_settings__description_withdrawal_lock_enable\":\"Enable to enhance account security and be eligible for the Account Protection Programme, if applicable\",\"web_settings__error_avatar_update_failed\":\"Failed to update avatar\",\"web_settings__error_notification_categories_load_failed\":\"Failed to load notification categories\",\"web_settings__error_notification_settings_load_failed\":\"Failed to load notification settings\",\"web_settings__error_notification_settings_update_failed\":\"Failed to update notification settings\",\"web_settings__error_operation_timeout\":\"Operation timed out or an error occurred\",\"web_settings__error_passkey_ainvalid_verification_code\":\"Invalid code. Verification will be locked for 24 hours after 10 failed attempts.\",\"web_settings__error_passkey_auth_key_failed\":\"Failed to get authentication key. Please try again.\",\"web_settings__error_passkey_code_security\":\"Code Security Error\",\"web_settings__error_passkey_id_not_registrable\":\"The relying party ID is not a registrable domain suffix or equal to the current domain.\",\"web_settings__error_passkey_max_reached\":\"You've reached the maximum of 10 passkeys. Delete one to add more.\",\"web_settings__error_passkey_name_too_long\":\"Exceeds 40-character limit\",\"web_settings__error_passkey_no_active_totp\":\"No active TOTP found\",\"web_settings__error_passkey_not_valid\":\"Your passkey {passkey} can not be used in OG.com Web. Please add a new one.\",\"web_settings__error_passkey_too_many_verification