!\",\"web_og_connect_benefit_fast_track_description\":\"Skip steps you've already completed on Crypto.com\",\"web_og_connect_benefit_fast_track_title\":\"Fast-track setup\",\"web_og_connect_benefit_one_login_description\":\"Use your Crypto.com credentials to access OG.com\",\"web_og_connect_benefit_one_login_title\":\"One login\",\"web_og_connect_benefit_shared_wallet_description\":\"Access your Crypto.com balance on OG.com instantly\",\"web_og_connect_benefit_shared_wallet_title\":\"Shared wallet\",\"web_og_connect_button_proceed_to_login\":\"Proceed to Login\",\"web_og_connect_welcome_description\":\"OG.com is powered by Crypto.com and we found your existing account: {email}\",\"web_og_connect_welcome_title\":\"Welcome, Crypto.com user!\",\"web_onboarding_confirm_back_button_try_again\":\"Try Again\",\"web_onboarding_edd_intro_description\":\"To protect you from theft and fraud, we are required by government regulations to collect your personal information.\",\"web_onboarding_edd_intro_title\":\"Questionnaire\",\"web_onboarding_phone_enter_date_of_birth_label\":\"Date of birth\",\"web_onboarding_phone_enter_find_info_description\":\"Verify your identity quicker by simply entering your mobile number and date of birth. We'll handle the rest.\",\"web_onboarding_phone_enter_find_info_title\":\"Find your info\",\"web_onboarding_phone_enter_send_code\":\"Send code\",\"web_onboarding_phone_enter_title\":\"Enter mobile number\",\"web_onboarding_phone_enter_verified_disclaimer\":\"By continuing, I agree that \u003clink\u003eVerified\u003c/link\u003e (OG.com’s service provider) and its vendors may receive my personal info and autofill more info about me, including my social security number.\",\"web_onboarding_resubmit_label_there_is_an_issue_with_the_details\":\"There is an issue with the details you provided. Please resubmit.\",\"web_onboarding_revamp_kyc_status_hard_fail_content\":\"We regret to inform you that your account registration is unsuccessful. This may be due to